msgstr "此並行模式在列印板的 IDEX/IQEX 模式選擇器中顯示的名稱。專案以名稱記錄所用的模式，因此重新命名已被列印板使用的模式，會使這些列印板回退至主模式。不可為空，空白名稱會被替換為自動產生的名稱。"

# AI Translated
msgid "G-code emitted once at the start of a print that uses this mode, before the machine start G-code. This is where the printer is put into the matching firmware mode — for example a Klipper SET_PRINT_MODE call or a RepRapFirmware M567 — since the slicer only emits the Primary tool's paths and the firmware drives the Copy / Mirror tools. Placeholders are supported; use the edit button to browse them. Leave empty if the mode needs no firmware setup."
