msgid ""
"Applies smooth normals to the model.\n"
"\n"
"Requires manual scene reload to take effect (right-click on 3D view → \"Reload All\")."
msgstr ""
"對模型套用平滑法線。\n"
"\n"
"需要手動重新載入場景才會生效（在 3D 視圖上按滑鼠右鍵 → 「重新載入全部」）。"

msgid "Phong shading"
msgstr "Phong 著色"

# AI Translated
