msgstr "在擬真視圖中使用 Phong 著色。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable in Preview"
msgstr "在預覽中啟用"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Also applies realistic view to the Preview canvas, not just Prepare.\n"
"Preview draws the full toolpath geometry, so shadows and SSAO cost considerably more there than on a plain model."
msgstr ""
"擬真視圖也會套用於預覽畫布，而不僅限於準備。\n"
"預覽會繪製完整的工具路徑幾何，因此陰影與 SSAO 在預覽中的效能消耗遠高於一般模型。"

msgid "SSAO ambient occlusion"
msgstr "SSAO 環境光遮蔽"

# AI Translated
msgid "Applies SSAO in realistic view."
msgstr "在擬真視圖中套用 SSAO。"

# AI Translated
#. TRN Realistic-view shadow mode: the light stays fixed in the scene.
msgid "Static"
msgstr "靜態"

# AI Translated
#. TRN Realistic-view shadow mode: the light turns with the camera.
msgid "Orbit"
msgstr "環繞"

msgid "Shadows"
msgstr "陰影"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Renders cast shadows on the plate, other objects, and each object onto itself in realistic view.\n"
"Static: the light stays fixed in the world, so the shadows are only recomputed when the scene changes.\n"
"Orbit: the light turns with the camera, recomputing the shadows every frame the camera moves."
msgstr ""
"在擬真視圖中，於列印板、其他物件以及每個物件自身上渲染投射陰影。\n"
"靜態：光源固定於場景中，因此只有在場景變更時才會重新計算陰影。\n"
"環繞：光源隨相機轉動，相機移動時每一影格都會重新計算陰影。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Glossy toolpaths"
msgstr "亮面工具路徑"

# AI Translated
# Needs human review: Preferences > Preview tooltip: check 'highlight' (the specular shine) reads as 高光 and 'plain view' (the normal, non-realistic 3D view) as 一般視圖.
msgid ""
"Highlights the toolpaths in Preview as glossy plastic in realistic view.\n"
"Off, a translucent filament is matte and an opaque one keeps the highlight of the plain view."
msgstr ""
"在擬真視圖中，讓預覽中的工具路徑呈現亮面塑膠的高光。\n"
"關閉時，半透明線材為霧面，不透明線材則維持一般視圖的高光。"

msgid "Anti-aliasing"
msgstr "抗鋸齒"

msgid "MSAA Multiplier"
msgstr "MSAA 倍數"

msgid ""
"Set the Multi-Sample Anti-Aliasing level.\n"
"Higher values result in smoother edges, but the impact on performance is exponential.\n"
"Lower values improve performance, at the cost of jagged edges.\n"
"If disabled, its recommended to enable FXAA to reduce jagged edges with minimal performance impact.\n"
"\n"
"Requires application restart."
msgstr ""
"設定多重取樣抗鋸齒等級。\n"
"數值越高邊緣越平滑，但對效能的影響呈指數級增長。\n"
"數值越低可提升效能，但代價是邊緣出現鋸齒。\n"
"若停用，建議啟用 FXAA，以最小的效能影響來減少鋸齒邊緣。\n"
"\n"
"需要重新啟動應用程式。"

msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "停用"

msgid "FXAA post-processing"
msgstr "FXAA 後處理"

msgid ""
"Applies Fast Approximate Anti-Aliasing as a screen-space pass.\n"
"Useful for disabling or reducing the MSAA setting to improve performance.\n"
"\n"
"Takes effect immediately."
msgstr ""
"以螢幕空間處理的方式套用快速近似抗鋸齒。\n"
"適合用於停用或降低 MSAA 設定以提升效能。\n"
"\n"
"立即生效。"

msgid "FPS"
msgstr "FPS"

msgid "FPS cap"
msgstr "FPS 上限"

# AI Translated
msgid "(0 = unlimited)"
msgstr "（0 = 無限制）"

msgid ""
"Limits viewport frame rate to reduce GPU load and power usage.\n"
"Set to 0 for unlimited frame rate."
msgstr ""
"限制視埠影格率以降低 GPU 負載與耗電量。\n"
"設為 0 表示不限制影格率。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Reuse the 3D scene while idle"
msgstr "閒置時重複使用 3D 場景"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Skips redrawing the 3D scene when only the mouse cursor moves over the viewport,\n"
"and reuses the previous frame's scene instead. Reduces GPU load.\n"
"Disable it if the viewport shows stale or missing contents.\n"
"\n"
"Takes effect immediately."
msgstr ""
"當只有滑鼠游標在視埠上移動時，略過重新繪製 3D 場景，\n"
"改為重複使用上一影格的場景。可降低 GPU 負載。\n"
"若視埠顯示過時或缺少的內容，請停用此選項。\n"
"\n"
"立即生效。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Skip unchanged frames"
msgstr "略過未變更的影格"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Skips drawing a frame altogether when it would be identical to the one already on screen.\n"
"Only applies to frames that reuse the 3D scene, so it needs Reuse the 3D scene while idle.\n"
"Disable it if a hover highlight, tooltip or animation stops updating.\n"
"\n"
"Takes effect immediately."
msgstr ""
"當影格與螢幕上現有的影格完全相同時，完全略過繪製。\n"
"僅適用於重複使用 3D 場景的影格，因此需要啟用「閒置時重複使用 3D 場景」。\n"
"若懸停醒目提示、工具提示或動畫停止更新，請停用此選項。\n"
"\n"
"立即生效。"

msgid "Show FPS overlay"
msgstr "顯示 FPS 疊加層"

# AI Translated
msgid "Displays rendering counts in the top-right corner of the viewport."
msgstr "在視埠右上角顯示渲染計數。"

# AI Translated
msgid "FPS: frames presented to the screen per second."
msgstr "FPS：每秒呈現到螢幕上的影格數。"

# AI Translated
msgid "3D: frames per second that redrew the 3D scene."
msgstr "3D：每秒重新繪製 3D 場景的影格數。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Show render timings"
msgstr "顯示渲染時間"

# AI Translated
msgid "Displays how many milliseconds each part of a frame that redraws the 3D scene takes, in the top-right corner of the viewport."
msgstr "在視埠右上角顯示重新繪製 3D 場景的影格中，每個部分各花費多少毫秒。"

# AI Translated
msgid "CPU: time spent issuing the drawing commands."
msgstr "CPU：發出繪圖指令所花費的時間。"

# AI Translated
msgid "GPU: time the graphics card spent running them."
msgstr "GPU：顯示卡執行這些指令所花費的時間。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Adds a small overhead to each frame while enabled."
msgstr "啟用時會為每個影格增加少量額外負擔。"

# AI Translated
msgid "3D scene benchmark"
msgstr "3D 場景效能測試"

# AI Translated
msgid "Run"
msgstr "執行"

# AI Translated
msgid "Replaces the current project with the OrcaSliced Combo, then measures the frame rate and render timings while the camera turns around it in Prepare and Preview, and while the layer slider moves through the sliced layers."
msgstr "以 OrcaSliced Combo 取代目前專案，接著在相機於準備與預覽中環繞模型轉動時，以及層滑桿在已切片的各層間移動時，測量影格率與渲染時間。"

# AI Translated
msgid "G-code Preview"
msgstr "G-code 預覽"

# AI Translated
msgid "Default view type"
msgstr "預設檢視類型"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The color scheme the sliced preview opens with.\n"
"Automatic: Filament for multi material prints, Line Type for single material ones.\n"
"Last used: the view type you selected last.\n"
"Any other value always opens that view type.\n"
"You can still switch the view type in the preview afterwards."
msgstr ""
"開啟切片預覽時使用的配色方案。\n"
"自動：多材料列印使用「線材」，單一材料列印使用「走線類型」。\n"
"上次使用：您上次選擇的檢視類型。\n"
"其他任何值則一律以該檢視類型開啟。\n"
"之後您仍可在預覽中切換檢視類型。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Dim lower layers"
msgstr "使下方層變暗"

# AI Translated
msgid "When scrubbing the layer slider in the sliced preview, render the layers below the current one darkened so that only the layer being viewed is shown at full brightness."
msgstr "在切片預覽中拖曳層滑桿時，將目前層以下的各層算繪為變暗，如此只有正在檢視的層以全亮度顯示。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Dimmed layer brightness"
msgstr "變暗層的亮度"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"How brightly the dimmed layers are rendered when \"Dim lower layers\" is enabled.\n"
"99% is barely darkened, 0% renders them black. Capped at 99% because 100% would be the same as disabling the option."
msgstr ""
"啟用「使下方層變暗」時，變暗的層以多高的亮度顯示。\n"
"99% 幾乎不會變暗，0% 會顯示為全黑。上限為 99%，因為 100% 與停用此選項的效果相同。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Translucent filaments"
msgstr "半透明線材"

# AI Translated
msgid "Draw the toolpaths of filaments whose color is partly transparent as see-through, as the 3D view draws their objects. Turn it off to draw every filament opaque."
msgstr "將顏色帶有部分透明度的線材，其工具路徑以半透明方式繪製，如同 3D 視圖繪製其物件的方式。關閉後，所有線材皆以不透明方式繪製。"

