# AI Translated
#. TRN %1% is the IDEX/IQEX mode name, %2% the tool number, %3% a list of tools such as "T1, T2".
#, boost-format
msgid "IDEX/IQEX mode \"%1%\" prints with T%2%, but this plate's filaments are on %3%. Assign a filament loaded on T%2%, or switch this plate to Primary mode."
msgstr "IDEX/IQEX 模式「%1%」使用 T%2% 列印，但此列印板的線材位於 %3%。請指派已裝載於 T%2% 的線材，或將此列印板切換為主模式。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Raft is not compatible with belt printer mode."
msgstr "筏層與輸送帶列印裝置模式不相容。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Draft shield is not compatible with belt printer mode."
msgstr "防風罩與輸送帶列印裝置模式不相容。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Brim is not compatible with spiral vase mode on a belt printer. Disable one of them."
msgstr "在輸送帶列印裝置上，Brim 與螺旋花瓶模式不相容。請停用其中之一。"

# AI Translated
msgid "The belt is too steep for a brim, so no brim will be generated."
msgstr "輸送帶傾斜角度過大，不適合使用 Brim，因此不會產生 Brim。"

# AI Translated
msgid "A brim is only generated when the belt is tilted. Set a belt tilt angle, or remove the brim setting."
msgstr "僅在輸送帶傾斜時才會產生 Brim。請設定輸送帶傾斜角度，或移除 Brim 設定。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Belt printers support outer and inner brim only. Auto, Mouse ear and Painted brim are printed as Outer brim only, using Brim width."
msgstr "輸送帶列印裝置僅支援外側和內側 Brim。「自動」、「圓盤」和「繪製」Brim 會以「僅外側」方式列印，並使用「Brim 寬度」。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Brim-object gap separates the leading brim from the object's leading edge, which is the edge it is meant to anchor. Set the gap to 0 when using leading brim length."
msgstr "「Brim 與物件的間隙」會使前緣 Brim 與物件的前緣分離，而前緣正是前緣 Brim 要固定的邊。使用「前緣 Brim 長度」時，請將間隙設為 0。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Leading brim length extends ahead of each object along the belt, and Arrange does not reserve that space. Leave room between objects."
msgstr "「前緣 Brim 長度」會沿輸送帶向每個物件前方延伸，而「自動擺放」不會預留該空間。請在物件之間保留間距。"

# AI Translated
msgid "\"Leading edge only\" brim applies to belt printers. On this printer it is printed as an ordinary outer brim."
msgstr "「僅前緣」Brim 僅適用於輸送帶列印裝置。在此列印裝置上，它會以一般的外側 Brim 列印。"

# AI Translated
msgid "A gradient mixed filament is used, but 'Mixed color sublayer' is disabled. The gradient will not be printed."
msgstr "使用了漸層混合線材，但「混色子層」已停用。漸層將不會列印。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Smooth mode of timelapse is not supported when \"by object\" sequence is enabled."
msgstr "列印順序為「逐件」時，不支援平滑模式的縮時攝影。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Clumping detection is not supported when \"by object\" sequence is enabled."
msgstr "列印順序為「逐件」時，不支援結塊偵測。"

# AI Translated
msgid "The belt purge tower is not generated in \"By object\" print sequence; filament changes will not be purged."
msgstr "在「逐件」列印順序下不會產生輸送帶清理塔；線材更換時將不會清理。"

# AI Translated
msgid "The belt purge tower is enabled but the project has no purge tower object; filament changes will not be purged. Open the project in the application to generate the tower."
msgstr "已啟用輸送帶清理塔，但專案中沒有清理塔物件；線材更換時將不會清理。請在應用程式中開啟此專案以產生清理塔。"

# AI Translated
msgid "The project contains multiple managed belt purge towers. Reload the plate or toggle the belt purge tower off and on to regenerate it."
msgstr "專案中包含多個自動管理的輸送帶清理塔。請重新載入列印板，或將輸送帶清理塔關閉後再開啟，以重新產生。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Enabling both precise Z height and the prime tower may cause slicing errors."
msgstr "同時啟用精確 Z 高度和換料塔可能會導致切片錯誤。"

# AI Translated
msgid "A prime tower is required for clumping detection; otherwise, there may be flaws on the model."
msgstr "結塊偵測需要換料塔，否則模型上可能會有瑕疵。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Please select \"By object\" print sequence to print multiple objects in spiral vase mode."
msgstr "若要在螺旋花瓶模式下列印多個物件，請選擇「逐件」列印順序。"

# AI Translated
