#, boost-format
msgid "The belt purge tower cannot absorb the full purge volume: %1% mm³ in total could not be purged (worst layer: %2% mm³ at height %3%). The print may show color bleeding. Increase the belt purge tower width, or reduce flushing volumes."
msgstr "輸送帶清理塔無法容納完整的清理量：共有 %1% mm³ 無法清理（最差的層：高度 %3% 處的 %2% mm³）。列印可能出現混色。請增加輸送帶清理塔的寬度，或減少清理量。"

