msgid "Set the number of parallel printheads for machines like OrangeStorm Giga printer."
msgstr "設定 OrangeStorm Giga 等列印裝置的並行列印頭數量。"

msgid "Parallel printheads bed exclude areas"
msgstr "並行列印頭列印板排除區域"

# AI Translated
msgid "Ordered list of bed exclude areas by parallel printhead count. Item 1 applies to one printhead, item 2 to two printheads, and so on. Leave an item empty for no excluded area."
msgstr "依並行列印頭數量排序的熱床排除區域列表。第 1 項適用於一個列印頭，第 2 項適用於兩個列印頭，依此類推。項目留空表示沒有排除區域。"

msgid "Excluded bed area"
msgstr "熱床淨空區域"

# AI Translated
msgid "Unprintable area in XY plane. For example, X1 Series printers use the front left corner to cut filament during filament change. The area is expressed as a polygon in the format \"XxY, XxY, ...\". It constrains material and model placement, but allows machine travel. Configure toolhead collision volumes separately for G-code checking and travel avoidance."
msgstr "XY 平面上的不可列印區域。例如，X1 系列列印裝置在換料時會使用左前角來切斷線材。此區域以 \"XxY, XxY, ...\" 格式的多邊形表示。它會限制材料與模型的擺放位置，但允許機器空駛。請另外設定工具頭碰撞體積，用於 G-code 檢查與空駛避讓。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Toolhead collision volumes"
msgstr "工具頭碰撞體積"

# AI Translated
# Needs human review: "excluded bed area" is rendered 熱床淨空區域, the catalog's existing label for the Excluded bed area setting, so the glossary term 列印板 does not appear.
msgid "Collision volumes used for model and generated-material exclusion, G-code checking, and travel avoidance. Use \"XxY, XxY, ...\" for a full-height polygon or \"ZMIN..ZMAX;XxY, XxY, ...\" for a Z-limited volume. Separate multiple volumes with \"|\". These volumes are additional to the excluded bed area. Automatic arrangement conservatively uses the bounding box of a non-convex volume."
msgstr "用於排除模型與產生的材料、檢查 G-code 以及空駛避讓的碰撞體積。完整高度的多邊形請使用 \"XxY, XxY, ...\"，限定 Z 範圍的碰撞體積請使用 \"ZMIN..ZMAX;XxY, XxY, ...\"。多個碰撞體積之間以 \"|\" 分隔。這些碰撞體積是對熱床淨空區域的補充。自動排列時，非凸碰撞體積會保守地採用其邊界框。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Collision volume behavior"
msgstr "碰撞體積行為"

# AI Translated
msgid "Choose whether all nozzles use the same collision volumes, derive toolhead-relative volumes from each nozzle's XY offset, or configure independent volumes for every extruder. In individual mode, select each extruder on the Extruder page to configure its volumes."
msgstr "選擇所有噴嘴使用相同的碰撞體積、依各噴嘴的 XY 偏移推算相對於工具頭的碰撞體積，還是為每個擠出機個別設定。在個別模式下，請在「擠出機」頁面選取各擠出機來設定其碰撞體積。"

# AI Translated
#. TRN Collision volume modes: one set for all nozzles, one set moved by each nozzle's XY offset, or one set per extruder.
msgid "Shared by all nozzles"
msgstr "所有噴嘴共用"

# AI Translated
msgid "Toolhead-relative (nozzle offsets)"
msgstr "相對於工具頭（噴嘴偏移）"

# AI Translated
msgid "Individual per extruder"
msgstr "每個擠出機個別設定"

# AI Translated
msgid "Extruder collision volumes"
msgstr "擠出機碰撞體積"

# AI Translated
msgid "Collision volumes used only by this extruder in individual mode. Use the same polygon and optional Z-range format as the shared collision volumes. Leave empty for no collision volumes on this extruder. Automatic arrangement conservatively uses the bounding box of a non-convex volume."
msgstr "僅此擠出機在個別模式下使用的碰撞體積。格式與共用碰撞體積相同，即多邊形及可選的 Z 範圍。留空表示此擠出機沒有碰撞體積。自動排列時，非凸碰撞體積會保守地採用其邊界框。"

msgid "Bed custom texture"
msgstr "自訂列印板紋理"

msgid "Bed custom model"
msgstr "自訂列印板模型"

msgid "Elephant foot compensation"
msgstr "象腳補償"

# AI Translated
msgid "This shrinks the first layer on the build plate to compensate for elephant foot effect."
msgstr "縮小列印板上的首層，以補償象腳效應。"

msgid "Elephant foot compensation layers"
msgstr "象腳補償層數"

# AI Translated
msgid "The number of layers on which the elephant foot compensation will be active. The first layer will be shrunk by the elephant foot compensation value, then the next layers will be linearly shrunk less, up to the layer indicated by this value."
msgstr "象腳補償生效的層數。首層會依象腳補償值縮小，之後各層的縮小量線性遞減，直到此值指定的層為止。"

msgid "Elephant foot layers density"
msgstr "象腳層密度"

msgid ""
"Density of internal solid infill for Elephant foot layers compensation.\n"
"The initial value for the second layer is set.\n"
"Subsequent layers become linearly denser by the height specified in elefant_foot_compensation_layers."
msgstr ""
"用於象腳補償層的內部實心填充密度。\n"
"設定第二層的初始值。\n"
"後續層會依照 elefant_foot_compensation_layers 指定的高度線性增加密度。"

# AI Translated
msgid "This is the height for each layer. Smaller layer heights give greater accuracy but longer printing time."
msgstr "每一層的切片高度。層高越小，精度越高，但列印時間也越長。"

msgid "Printable height"
msgstr "可列印高度"

# AI Translated
msgid "This is the maximum printable height which is limited by the height of the build area."
msgstr "最大可列印高度，受列印區域的高度限制。"

