msgstr "忽略 HTTPS 憑證撤銷檢查"

# AI Translated
msgid "Ignore HTTPS certificate revocation checks in the case of missing or offline distribution points. One may want to enable this option for self signed certificates if connection fails."
msgstr "當發佈點遺失或離線時，忽略 HTTPS 憑證撤銷檢查。若連線失敗，使用自我簽署憑證時可考慮啟用此選項。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Names of presets related to the physical printer."
msgstr "與實體列印裝置相關的預設名稱。"

msgid "Authorization Type"
msgstr "授權類型"

msgid "API key"
msgstr "API 金鑰"

msgid "HTTP digest"
msgstr "HTTP 摘要"

# AI Translated
msgid "Configuration for the plugin capabilities this preset uses, overriding the global Capabilities configuration. Stored as a raw JSON array and edited through the dialog behind the button, never typed in directly."
msgstr "此預設所使用外掛功能的設定，會覆寫全域的「功能」設定。以原始 JSON 陣列儲存，並透過按鈕開啟的對話框編輯，切勿直接輸入。"

msgid "Avoid crossing walls"
msgstr "避免跨越外牆"

# AI Translated
msgid "This detours to avoid traveling across walls, which may cause blobs on the surface."
msgstr "空駛時繞行，避免跨越外牆而在模型表面產生斑點。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Avoid crossing walls - Max detour length"
msgstr "避免跨越外牆：最大繞行長度"

# AI Translated
msgid "Maximum detour distance for avoiding crossing wall: The printer won't detour if the detour distance is larger than this value. Detour length could be specified either as an absolute value or as percentage (for example 50%) of a direct travel path. A value of 0 will disable this."
msgstr "避免跨越外牆時的最大繞行距離：若繞行距離大於此值，則不繞行。繞行距離可設為絕對值，或直線空駛路徑長度的百分比（例如 50%）。設為 0 表示停用。"

msgid "mm or %"
msgstr "mm 或 %"

msgid "Other layers"
msgstr "其它層"

# AI Translated
msgid "This is the bed temperature for layers except for the first one. A value of 0 means the filament does not support printing on the Cool Plate SuperTack."
msgstr "首層之外各層的熱床溫度。值為 0 表示該線材不適用於增穩低溫列印板。"

# AI Translated
msgid "This is the bed temperature for layers except for the first one. A value of 0 means the filament does not support printing on the Cool Plate."
