msgstr "TPMS-FK 結構"

msgid "Gyroid"
msgstr "螺旋體"

# AI Translated
msgid "Sparse infill smooth factor"
msgstr "稀疏填充平滑係數"

# AI Translated
msgid "Controls how strongly sparse infill corners are rounded. 0% keeps the original sharp path, while 100% produces the largest possible curves between adjacent infill lines."
msgstr "控制稀疏填充轉角的圓滑程度。0% 保持原有的銳利路徑，100% 則在相鄰填充線之間產生盡可能大的圓弧。"

# AI Translated
msgid "This is the acceleration of top surface infill. Using a lower value may improve top surface quality."
msgstr "頂面填充的加速度。使用較低的值可能會改善頂面品質。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Acceleration of outer wall: using a lower value can improve quality."
msgstr "外牆的加速度。使用較低的值可以提高品質。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Acceleration of inner walls."
msgstr "內牆的加速度。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Acceleration of sparse infill. If the value is expressed as a percentage (e.g. 100%), it will be calculated based on the default acceleration."
msgstr "稀疏填充的加速度。如果以百分比表示（例如 100%），將以預設加速度為基準計算。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Acceleration of internal solid infill. If the value is expressed as a percentage (e.g. 100%), it will be calculated based on the default acceleration."
msgstr "內部實心填充的加速度。如果以百分比表示（例如 100%），將以預設加速度為基準計算。"

# AI Translated
msgid "This is the printing acceleration for the first layer. Using limited acceleration can improve build plate adhesion."
msgstr "首層的列印加速度。限制加速度可以改善列印板附著力。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable accel_to_decel"
msgstr "啟用 accel_to_decel"

# AI Translated
msgid "Klipper's max_accel_to_decel will be adjusted automatically."
msgstr "Klipper 的 max_accel_to_decel 將自動調整。"

# AI Translated
msgid "accel_to_decel"
msgstr "accel_to_decel"

# AI Translated
#, no-c-format, no-boost-format
msgid "Klipper's max_accel_to_decel will be adjusted to this % of acceleration."
msgstr "Klipper 的 max_accel_to_decel 將調整為加速度的此 %。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Default jerk."
msgstr "預設急衝速度。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Marlin Firmware Junction Deviation (replaces the traditional XY Jerk setting)."
msgstr "Marlin 韌體轉角偏差（取代傳統的 XY 急衝速度設定）。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Jerk of outer walls."
msgstr "外牆的急衝速度。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Jerk of inner walls."
msgstr "內牆的急衝速度。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Jerk for top surface."
msgstr "頂面的急衝速度。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Jerk for infill."
msgstr "填充的急衝速度。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Jerk for the first layer."
msgstr "首層的急衝速度。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Jerk for travel."
msgstr "空駛的急衝速度。"

msgid ""
"Travel jerk of first layer.\n"
"The percentage value is relative to Travel Jerk."
msgstr ""
"首層的空駛急衝速度。\n"
"百分比值相對於空駛急衝速度。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Line width of the first layer. If expressed as a %, it will be computed over the nozzle diameter."
msgstr "首層的線寬。如果以 % 表示，將以噴嘴直徑為基準計算。"

msgid "First layer height"
msgstr "首層層高"

msgid "Height of the first layer. Making the first layer height thicker can improve build plate adhesion."
msgstr "首層層高。加厚首層層高有助於提高列印板附著力。"

# AI Translated
msgid "This is the speed for the walls and brim of the first layer."
msgstr "首層的牆和 Brim 的列印速度。"

msgid "First layer infill"
msgstr "首層填充"

# AI Translated
msgid "This is the speed for the first layer except for walls and brim, such as infill, gap fill and support."
msgstr "首層中除牆和 Brim 以外部分的列印速度，例如填充、縫隙填充和支撐。"

msgid "First layer travel speed"
msgstr "首層空駛速度"

# AI Translated
msgid "Travel speed of the first layer."
msgstr "首層的空駛速度。"

msgid "Number of slow layers"
msgstr "慢速層數量"

# AI Translated
msgid "The first few layers are printed slower than normal. The speed is gradually increased in a linear fashion over the specified number of layers."
msgstr "前幾層會以比正常慢的速度列印。速度會在指定的層數內線性逐漸提高。"

# AI Translated
msgid "First layer nozzle temperature"
msgstr "首層噴嘴溫度"

# AI Translated
msgid "Nozzle temperature for printing the first layer with this filament"
msgstr "使用此線材列印首層時的噴嘴溫度"

msgid "Full fan speed at layer"
msgstr "滿速風扇在"

# AI Translated
msgid "Fan speed will be ramped up linearly from zero at layer \"close_fan_the_first_x_layers\" to maximum at layer \"full_fan_speed_layer\". \"full_fan_speed_layer\" will be ignored if lower than \"close_fan_the_first_x_layers\", in which case the fan will be running at maximum allowed speed at layer \"close_fan_the_first_x_layers\" + 1."
msgstr "風扇速度會從第 \"close_fan_the_first_x_layers\" 層的零速，線性提升到第 \"full_fan_speed_layer\" 層的最大速度。若 \"full_fan_speed_layer\" 低於 \"close_fan_the_first_x_layers\"，則會忽略 \"full_fan_speed_layer\"，此時風扇會在第 \"close_fan_the_first_x_layers\" + 1 層以允許的最大速度運轉。"

msgid "layer"
msgstr "層"

# AI Translated
msgid "First layer fan speed"
msgstr "首層風扇速度"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Sets an exact fan speed for the first layer, overriding all other cooling settings. Useful for protecting 3D-printed toolhead parts (e.g. Voron-style ABS/ASA ducts) from a hot bed. A small amount of airflow cools the ducts down, without using full cooling that may in certain conditions hurt first-layer adhesion.\n"
"From the second layer onwards, normal cooling resumes.\n"
"If \"Full fan speed at layer\" is also set, the fan ramps smoothly from this value on the first layer up to your target by the chosen layer.\n"
"Only available when \"No cooling for the first\" is 0.\n"
"Set to -1 to disable it."
msgstr ""
"為首層設定精確的風扇速度，並覆寫所有其他冷卻設定。適用於保護 3D 列印的工具頭零件（例如 Voron 風格的 ABS/ASA 導風管）免受熱床影響。少量氣流即可冷卻導風管，而不必使用在某些情況下可能損害首層附著的全速冷卻。\n"
"從第二層開始恢復正常冷卻。\n"
"若同時設定了「滿速風扇在」，風扇會從首層的此數值平順提升，到所選的層時達到您的目標。\n"
"僅在「關閉冷卻的前」為 0 時可用。\n"
"設為 -1 可停用。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Support interface fan speed"
msgstr "支撐面風扇速度"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This part cooling fan speed is applied when printing support interfaces. Setting this parameter to a higher than regular speed reduces the layer binding strength between supports and the supported part, making them easier to separate.\n"
"Set to -1 to disable it.\n"
"This setting is overridden by disable_fan_first_layers."
msgstr ""
"列印支撐面時使用此物件冷卻風扇速度。將此參數設為高於一般的速度，可降低支撐與受支撐零件之間的層間黏結強度，使其更容易分離。\n"
"設為 -1 可停用。\n"
"此設定會被 disable_fan_first_layers 覆寫。"

msgid "Internal bridges fan speed"
msgstr "內部橋接風扇轉速"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"The part cooling fan speed used for all internal bridges. Set to -1 to use the overhang fan speed settings instead.\n"
"\n"
"Reducing the internal bridges fan speed, compared to your regular fan speed, can help reduce part warping due to excessive cooling applied over a large surface for a prolonged period of time."
msgstr ""
"所有內部橋接使用的物件冷卻風扇速度。設為 -1 則改用懸空風扇速度設定。\n"
"\n"
"與一般風扇速度相比，降低內部橋接風扇速度有助於減少因長時間對大面積過度冷卻而導致的零件翹曲。"

msgid "Ironing fan speed"
msgstr "熨燙時風扇速度"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This part cooling fan speed is applied when ironing. Setting this parameter to a lower than regular speed reduces possible nozzle clogging due to the low volumetric flow rate, making the interface smoother.\n"
"Set to -1 to disable it."
msgstr ""
"熨燙時使用此物件冷卻風扇速度。將此參數設為低於一般的速度，可減少因體積流量偏低而可能造成的噴嘴堵塞，使表面更平滑。\n"
"設為 -1 可停用。"

msgid "Ironing flow"
msgstr "熨燙流量"

# AI Translated
msgid "Filament-specific override for ironing flow. This allows you to customize the ironing flow for each filament type. Too high value results in overextrusion on the surface."
msgstr "針對熨燙流量的線材專屬覆寫設定，可為每種線材類型自訂熨燙流量。值過高會導致表面過度擠出。"

msgid "Ironing line spacing"
msgstr "熨燙間距"

# AI Translated
msgid "Filament-specific override for ironing line spacing. This allows you to customize the spacing between ironing lines for each filament type."
msgstr "針對熨燙線間距的線材專屬覆寫設定，可為每種線材類型自訂熨燙線之間的間距。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Ironing inset"
msgstr "熨燙內縮距離"

# AI Translated
msgid "Filament-specific override for ironing inset. This allows you to customize the distance to keep from the edges when ironing for each filament type."
msgstr "針對熨燙內縮的線材專屬覆寫設定，可為每種線材類型自訂熨燙時與邊緣保持的距離。"

msgid "Ironing speed"
msgstr "熨燙速度"

# AI Translated
msgid "Filament-specific override for ironing speed. This allows you to customize the print speed of ironing lines for each filament type."
msgstr "針對熨燙速度的線材專屬覆寫設定，可為每種線材類型自訂熨燙線的列印速度。"

# AI Translated
msgid "This setting makes the toolhead randomly jitter while printing walls so that the surface has a rough textured look. This setting controls the fuzzy position."
msgstr "列印牆時讓工具頭隨機抖動，使表面呈現粗糙的紋理外觀。此設定控制絨毛表面的位置。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Painted only"
msgstr "僅繪製區域"

msgid "Contour"
msgstr "輪廓"

msgid "Hole"
msgstr "孔洞"

msgid "Contour and hole"
msgstr "輪廓和孔"

msgid "All walls"
msgstr "所有牆"

msgid "Fuzzy skin thickness"
msgstr "絨毛表面厚度"

# AI Translated
msgid "The width of jittering: it’s recommended to keep this lower than the outer wall line width."
msgstr "抖動的寬度。建議小於外牆線寬。"

msgid "Fuzzy skin point distance"
msgstr "絨毛表面點間距"

# AI Translated
msgid "The average distance between the random points introduced on each line segment."
msgstr "在每條線段上插入的隨機點之間的平均距離。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Apply fuzzy skin to first layer"
msgstr "首層套用絨毛表面"

# AI Translated
msgid "Whether to apply fuzzy skin on the first layer."
msgstr "是否在首層套用絨毛表面。"

msgid "Fuzzy skin generator mode"
msgstr "絨毛表面生成器模式"

# AI Translated
#, no-c-format, no-boost-format
msgid ""
"Fuzzy skin generation mode. Works only with Arachne!\n"
"Displacement: Сlassic mode when the pattern is formed by shifting the nozzle sideways from the original path.\n"
"Extrusion: The mode when the pattern formed by the amount of extruded plastic. This is the fast and straight algorithm without unnecessary nozzle shake that gives a smooth pattern. But it is more useful for forming loose walls in the entire they array.\n"
"Combined: Joint mode [Displacement] + [Extrusion]. The appearance of the walls is similar to [Displacement] Mode, but it leaves no pores between the perimeters.\n"
"\n"
"Attention! The [Extrusion] and [Combined] modes works only the fuzzy_skin_thickness parameter not more than the thickness of printed loop. At the same time, the width of the extrusion for a particular layer should also not be below a certain level. It is usually equal 15-25% of a layer height. Therefore, the maximum fuzzy skin thickness with a perimeter width of 0.4 mm and a layer height of 0.2 mm will be 0.4-(0.2*0.25)=±0.35mm! If you enter a higher parameter than this, the error Flow::spacing() will displayed, and the model will not be sliced. You can choose this number until this error is repeated."
msgstr ""
"絨毛表面生成模式。僅適用於 Arachne！\n"
"位移：經典模式，透過讓噴嘴偏離原始路徑向側面移動來形成圖案。\n"
"擠出：以擠出塑膠的量來形成圖案。這是一種快速、直接的演算法，沒有多餘的噴嘴抖動，可產生平滑的圖案。但它更適合用於在整組牆中形成鬆散的牆。\n"
"合併：[位移] + [擠出] 的聯合模式。牆的外觀與 [位移] 模式相似，但牆之間不會留下孔隙。\n"
"\n"
"注意！[擠出] 和 [合併] 模式僅在 fuzzy_skin_thickness 參數不大於所列印環的厚度時有效。同時，特定層的擠出寬度也不應低於一定水準，通常為層高的 15-25%。因此，在牆線寬為 0.4 mm、層高為 0.2 mm 時，最大絨毛表面厚度為 0.4-(0.2*0.25)=±0.35mm！若輸入的參數高於此值，將顯示 Flow::spacing() 錯誤，且模型無法切片。您可以調整此數值，直到不再出現此錯誤。"

msgid "Displacement"
msgstr "位移"

msgid "Extrusion"
msgstr "擠出"

msgid "Combined"
msgstr "合併"

# AI Translated
msgid "Fuzzy skin noise type"
msgstr "絨毛表面雜訊類型"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Noise type to use for fuzzy skin generation:\n"
"Classic: Classic uniform random noise.\n"
"Perlin: Perlin noise, which gives a more consistent texture.\n"
"Billow: Similar to perlin noise, but clumpier.\n"
"Ridged Multifractal: Ridged noise with sharp, jagged features. Creates marble-like textures.\n"
"Voronoi: Divides the surface into voronoi cells, and displaces each one by a random amount. Creates a patchwork texture.\n"
"Ripple: Uniform ripple pattern that ripples left and right of the original path. Repeating pattern, woven appearance."
msgstr ""
"用於產生絨毛表面的雜訊類型：\n"
"經典：經典的均勻隨機雜訊。\n"
"柏林：柏林雜訊，能產生更一致的紋理。\n"
"波狀：類似柏林雜訊，但更為團塊狀。\n"
"脊狀多重分形：具有銳利、鋸齒狀特徵的脊狀雜訊，可產生大理石般的紋理。\n"
"沃羅諾伊：將表面分割為沃羅諾伊單元，並將每個單元隨機位移一定量，可產生拼布般的紋理。\n"
"漣漪：均勻的漣漪圖案，在原始路徑的左右兩側起伏。重複的圖案，呈現編織般的外觀。"

msgid "Classic"
msgstr "經典"

msgid "Perlin"
msgstr "柏林"

msgid "Billow"
msgstr "波狀"

msgid "Ridged Multifractal"
msgstr "脊狀多重分形"

msgid "Voronoi"
msgstr "沃羅諾伊"

msgid "Ripple"
msgstr "漣漪"

# AI Translated
msgid "Fuzzy skin feature size"
msgstr "絨毛表面特徵尺寸"

# AI Translated
msgid "The base size of the coherent noise features, in mm. Higher values will result in larger features."
msgstr "相干雜訊特徵的基礎尺寸（單位：mm）。數值越大，特徵越大。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Fuzzy Skin Noise Octaves"
msgstr "絨毛表面雜訊倍頻"

# AI Translated
msgid "The number of octaves of coherent noise to use. Higher values increase the detail of the noise, but also increase computation time."
msgstr "要使用的相干雜訊倍頻數。數值越高，雜訊細節越多，但運算時間也越長。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Fuzzy skin noise persistence"
msgstr "絨毛表面雜訊持續度"

# AI Translated
msgid "The decay rate for higher octaves of the coherent noise. Lower values will result in smoother noise."
msgstr "相干雜訊高倍頻的衰減率。數值越低，雜訊越平滑。"

msgid "Number of ripples per layer"
msgstr "每層的漣漪數量"

msgid "Controls how many full cycles of ripples will be added per layer."
msgstr "控制每層加入多少個完整週期的漣漪。"

msgid "Ripple offset"
msgstr "漣漪偏移"

msgid ""
"Shifts the ripple phase forward along the print path by the specified percentage of a wavelength each layer period.\n"
"- 0% keeps every layer identical.\n"
"- 50% shifts the pattern by half a wavelength, effectively inverting the phase.\n"
"- 100% shifts the pattern by a full wavelength, returning to the original phase.\n"
"\n"
"The shift is applied once every number of layers set by Layers between ripple offset, so layers within the same group are printed identically."
msgstr ""
"每個層週期會依指定的波長百分比，將漣漪相位沿列印路徑向前位移。\n"
"- 0% 會讓每一層保持相同。\n"
"- 50% 會將圖案位移半個波長，等於反轉相位。\n"
"- 100% 會將圖案位移一個完整波長，回到原始相位。\n"
"\n"
"此位移會依「漣漪偏移間隔層數」設定每隔指定層數套用一次，因此同一組內的各層會以相同方式列印。"

msgid "Layers between ripple offset"
msgstr "漣漪偏移間隔層數"

msgid ""
"Specifies how many consecutive layers share the same ripple phase before the offset is applied.\n"
"For example:\n"
"- 1 = Layer 1 is printed with the base ripple pattern, then layer 2 is shifted by the configured offset, then layer 3 returns to the base pattern, and so on.\n"
"- 3 = Layers 1 to 3 are printed with the base ripple pattern, then layers 4 to 6 are shifted by the configured offset, then layers 7 to 9 return to the base pattern, etc."
msgstr ""
"指定在套用偏移之前，有多少個連續層共用相同的漣漪相位。\n"
"例如：\n"
"- 1 = 第 1 層以基礎漣漪圖案列印，接著第 2 層以設定的偏移移位，然後第 3 層回到基礎圖案，依此類推。\n"
"- 3 = 第 1 至 3 層以基礎漣漪圖案列印，接著第 4 至 6 層以設定的偏移移位，然後第 7 至 9 層回到基礎圖案，依此類推。"

msgid "Filter out tiny gaps"
msgstr "忽略微小間隙"

msgid "Layers and Perimeters"
msgstr "層和牆"

# AI Translated
msgid "Don't print gap fill with a length is smaller than the threshold specified (in mm). This setting applies to top, bottom and solid infill and, if using the classic perimeter generator, to wall gap fill."
msgstr "若縫隙填充的長度小於設定的臨界值（以 mm 計），則不列印該填充。此設定適用於頂部、底部和實心填充，以及使用經典牆產生器時的牆體縫隙填充。"

# AI Translated
msgid "This is the speed for gap infill. Gaps usually have irregular line width and should be printed more slowly."
msgstr "縫隙填充的速度。縫隙的線寬通常不規則，應以較慢的速度列印。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Precise Z height"
msgstr "精確 Z 高度"

msgid "Enable this to get precise Z height of object after slicing. It will get the precise object height by fine-tuning the layer heights of the last few layers. Note that this is an experimental parameter."
msgstr "啟用此選項可以在切片後確保物件的 Z 軸高度更加精確。此功能透過微調最後幾層的層高來達成精確的物件高度。請注意，這是一個實驗性功能。"

msgid "Arc fitting"
msgstr "圓弧擬合"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Fit G2 and G3 arc moves to the toolpaths. Walls and surfaces are fitted within the resolution, while sparse infill, supports and the wipe tower use fixed tolerances.\n"
" - Disabled: only straight G1 moves are used.\n"
" - Enabled: arcs are fitted to all toolpaths.\n"
" - Sparse infill only: arcs are fitted to the sparse infill only, which shortens the G-code of curved infill patterns without affecting the walls and surfaces.\n"
"\n"
"Note: For Klipper machines, Disabled is recommended. Klipper splits arcs back into line segments, which lowers the surface quality and can increase the print time."
msgstr ""
"將 G2 和 G3 圓弧移動擬合到工具路徑。牆與表面會在解析度範圍內擬合，而稀疏填充、支撐和換料塔則使用固定公差。\n"
" - 停用：僅使用直線 G1 移動。\n"
" - 啟用：對所有工具路徑擬合圓弧。\n"
" - 僅稀疏填充：僅對稀疏填充擬合圓弧，可縮短弧形填充圖案的 G-code，且不影響牆與表面。\n"
"\n"
"注意：對於 Klipper 機器，建議停用。Klipper 會將圓弧重新拆分為線段，這會降低表面品質，並可能增加列印時間。"

msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "啟用"

# AI Translated
msgid "Sparse infill only"
msgstr "僅稀疏填充"

msgid "Add line number"
msgstr "標註行號"

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable this to add line number(Nx) at the beginning of each G-code line."
msgstr "啟用此選項可在每行 G-code 的開頭加上行號（Nx）。"

msgid "Scan first layer"
msgstr "首層檢查"

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable this to allow the camera on the printer to check the quality of the first layer."
msgstr "啟用此選項後，列印裝置上的攝影機會檢查首層的列印品質。"

msgid "Power Loss Recovery"
msgstr "斷電還原"

# AI Translated
msgid "Choose how to control power loss recovery. When set to Printer configuration, the slicer will not emit power loss recovery G-code and will leave the printer's configuration unchanged. Applicable to Bambu Lab or Marlin 2 firmware based printers."
msgstr "選擇控制斷電還原的方式。設為「列印裝置設定」時，切片軟體不會輸出斷電還原 G-code，並保留列印裝置原有的設定。適用於採用 Bambu Lab 或 Marlin 2 韌體的列印裝置。"

msgid "Printer configuration"
msgstr "列印裝置設定"

msgid "Nozzle type"
msgstr "噴嘴類型"

# AI Translated
msgid "The metallic material of the nozzle: This determines the abrasive resistance of the nozzle and what kind of filament can be printed."
msgstr "噴嘴的金屬材料。這決定了噴嘴的耐磨性，以及可以列印哪些線材。"

msgid "Hardened steel"
msgstr "硬化鋼"

msgid "Stainless steel"
msgstr "不鏽鋼"

msgid "Tungsten carbide"
msgstr "碳化鎢"

msgid "Nozzle HRC"
msgstr "噴嘴洛氏硬度"

msgid "The nozzle's hardness. Zero means no checking for nozzle hardness during slicing."
msgstr "噴嘴硬度。零值表示在切片時不檢查噴嘴硬度。"

msgid "HRC"
msgstr "洛氏硬度"

msgid "Printer structure"
msgstr "列印裝置結構"

# AI Translated
msgid "The physical arrangement and components of a printing device."
msgstr "列印裝置的實體結構與元件。"

msgid "CoreXY"
msgstr "CoreXY"

msgid "I3"
msgstr "I3"

msgid "Hbot"
msgstr "Hbot"

msgid "Delta"
msgstr "Delta"

msgid "Best object position"
msgstr "最佳物件位置"

# AI Translated
msgid "Best auto arranging position in range [0,1] w.r.t. bed shape."
msgstr "自動擺放的最佳位置，範圍為 [0,1]，相對於列印板形狀。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable this option if machine has auxiliary part cooling fan. G-code command: M106 P2 S(0-255)."
msgstr "如果列印裝置配有輔助物件冷卻風扇，請啟用此選項。G-code 指令：M106 P2 S(0-255)。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Fan direction"
msgstr "風扇方向"

# AI Translated
msgid "Cooling fan direction of the printer"
msgstr "列印裝置冷卻風扇的方向"

# AI Translated
msgid "Both"
msgstr "兩者"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Start the fan this number of seconds earlier than its target start time (you can use fractional seconds). It assumes infinite acceleration for this time estimation, and will only take into account G1 and G0 moves (arc fitting is unsupported).\n"
"It won't move fan commands from custom G-code (they act as a sort of 'barrier').\n"
"It won't move fan commands into the start G-code if the 'only custom start G-code' is activated.\n"
"Use 0 to deactivate."
msgstr ""
"比目標啟動時間提早此秒數啟動風扇（可使用小數）。此時間估算假設加速度無限大，且只計入 G1 和 G0 移動（不支援圓弧擬合）。\n"
"不會移動自訂 G-code 中的風扇指令（這些指令相當於一道「屏障」）。\n"
"若已啟用「僅自訂起始 G-code」，不會將風扇指令移入起始 G-code。\n"
"設為 0 以停用。"

msgid "Only overhangs"
msgstr "僅懸空"

# AI Translated
msgid "Will only take into account the delay for the cooling of overhangs."
msgstr "僅針對懸空的冷卻計入此延遲。"

msgid "Fan kick-start time"
msgstr "風扇啟動時間"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Emit a max fan speed command for this amount of seconds before reducing to target speed to kick-start the cooling fan.\n"
"This is useful for fans where a low PWM/power may be insufficient to get the fan started spinning from a stop, or to get the fan up to speed faster.\n"
"Set to 0 to deactivate."
msgstr ""
"啟動冷卻風扇時，先以最大風扇速度運轉此秒數，再降至目標速度。\n"
"當低 PWM／功率不足以讓風扇從靜止開始轉動，或想讓風扇更快達到轉速時，此功能很有用。\n"
"設為 0 以停用。"

msgid "Minimum non-zero part cooling fan speed"
msgstr "最小非零物件冷卻風扇速度"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Some part-cooling fans cannot start spinning when commanded below a certain PWM duty cycle. When set above 0, any non-zero part-cooling fan command will be raised to at least this percentage so the fan reliably starts. A fan command of 0 (fan off) is always honoured exactly. This clamp is applied after every other fan calculation (first-layer ramp, layer-time interpolation, overhang/bridge/support-interface/ironing overrides), so scaling still operates within the range [this value, 100%].\n"
"If your firmware already disables the fan below a threshold (for example Klipper's [fan] off_below: 0.10 shuts the fan off whenever the commanded duty cycle is below 10%), this option and the firmware threshold should ideally be set to the same value. Matching them (e.g. off_below: 0.10 in Klipper and 10% here) guarantees the slicer never emits a non-zero value that the firmware would silently drop, and the fan never receives a value below the one you know it can actually spool at.\n"
"Set to 0 to deactivate."
msgstr ""
"某些物件冷卻風扇在指令值低於特定 PWM 工作週期時無法開始轉動。當設定為大於 0 時，任何非零的物件冷卻風扇指令都會被提高到至少此百分比，以確保風扇能可靠地啟動。風扇指令為 0（關閉風扇）時一律精確遵循。此限制會在所有其他風扇計算（首層漸增、層時間插值、懸空/橋接/支撐面/熨燙覆寫）之後套用，因此縮放仍會在 [此值, 100%] 範圍內運作。\n"
"如果您的韌體已經在低於某個臨界值時停用風扇（例如 Klipper 的 [fan] off_below: 0.10 會在指令工作週期低於 10% 時關閉風扇），則此選項與韌體臨界值最好設定為相同的值。讓兩者相符（例如 Klipper 中的 off_below: 0.10 與此處的 10%）可確保切片軟體永遠不會發出韌體會默默捨棄的非零值，且風扇永遠不會收到低於您已知它實際能啟動轉動的值。\n"
"設定為 0 以停用。"

msgid "Time cost"
msgstr "時間成本"

# AI Translated
msgid "The printer cost per hour."
msgstr "列印裝置每小時的成本。"

msgid "money/h"
msgstr "元/小時"

# AI Translated
msgid "Support controlling chamber temperature"
msgstr "支援控制腔體溫度"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"This option is enabled if the machine supports controlling the chamber temperature\n"
"G-code command: M141 S(0-255)"
msgstr ""
"若支援控制腔體溫度，請啟用此選項\n"
"G-code 指令：M141 S(0-255)"

msgid "Support air filtration"
msgstr "支援空氣過濾"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Enable this if the printer supports air filtration\n"
"G-code command: M106 P3 S(0-255)"
msgstr ""
"如果列印裝置支援空氣過濾，請啟用此選項\n"
"G-code 指令：M106 P3 S(0-255)"

msgid "Use cooling filter"
msgstr "開啟冷卻過濾"

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable this if the printer supports a cooling filter"
msgstr "如果列印裝置支援冷卻過濾，請啟用此選項"

msgid "G-code flavor"
msgstr "G-code 風格"

# AI Translated
msgid "What kind of G-code the printer is compatible with."
msgstr "列印裝置相容的 G-code 風格。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Marlin (legacy)"
msgstr "Marlin（舊版）"

msgid "Klipper"
msgstr "Klipper"

# AI Translated
msgid "Skip G-code config block"
msgstr "略過 G-code 設定區塊"

# AI Translated
msgid "Do not write the CONFIG_BLOCK (slicer configuration key/value pairs) into the G-code file. This can help with printers whose firmware crashes when parsing these comment lines (e.g. Anycubic go-klipper). Note: the G-code file will no longer contain slicer settings, so importing it back into OrcaSlicer will not restore the configuration."
msgstr "不將 CONFIG_BLOCK（切片軟體設定的鍵值對）寫入 G-code 檔案。這對於韌體在解析這些註解行時會當機的列印裝置（例如 Anycubic go-klipper）有幫助。注意：G-code 檔案將不再包含切片設定，因此重新匯入 OrcaSlicer 時無法還原設定。"

msgid "Pellet Modded Printer"
msgstr "顆粒改裝列印裝置"

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable this option if your printer uses pellets instead of filaments."
msgstr "若您的列印裝置使用塑膠顆粒而非線材，請啟用此選項。"

msgid "Support multi bed types"
msgstr "支援多種熱床類型"

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable this option if you want to use multiple bed types."
msgstr "若要使用多種熱床類型，請啟用此選項。"

msgid "Label objects"
msgstr "標註物件"

# AI Translated
# Needs human review: English names Prusa's Wipe into Object / Wipe into Infill; translation quotes Orca's Flush into this object / Flush into objects' infill labels (printconfig3) instead
msgid "Enable this to add comments into the G-code labeling print moves with what object they belong to, which is useful for the Octoprint CancelObject plug-in. This setting is NOT compatible with Single Extruder Multi Material setup and Wipe into Object / Wipe into Infill."
msgstr "啟用此選項會在 G-code 中加入註解，標示每段列印移動所屬的物件，適用於 Octoprint CancelObject 外掛程式。此設定與「單擠出機多線材」設定以及「將換料的廢料使用在這個物件」/「將換料的廢料使用在物件的填充」不相容。"

msgid "Exclude objects"
msgstr "物件排除"

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable this option to add EXCLUDE OBJECT command in G-code."
msgstr "啟用此選項以在 G-code 中加入 EXCLUDE OBJECT 指令。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Outline tolerance"
msgstr "輪廓線公差"

# AI Translated
msgid "Maximum deviation of the object outline written to EXCLUDE_OBJECT_DEFINE from the original outline. Larger values give fewer points, which helps firmware that stalls while parsing G-code with many objects. 0 keeps every point."
msgstr "寫入 EXCLUDE_OBJECT_DEFINE 的物件輪廓線與原始輪廓線之間的最大偏差。數值越大，點數越少，有助於避免韌體在解析包含大量物件的 G-code 時卡住。0 表示保留所有點。"

msgid "Verbose G-code"
msgstr "詳細 G-code"

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable this to get a commented G-code file, with each line explained by a descriptive text. If you print from SD card, the additional weight of the file could make your firmware slow down."
msgstr "啟用此選項可產生附有註解的 G-code 檔案，每一行都以描述文字說明。如果您從 SD 卡列印，檔案增加的大小可能會使韌體變慢。"

msgid "High precision G-code (experimental)"
msgstr ""

msgid "Write X, Y, Z, I and J with 4 decimal places instead of 3, and E with 6 instead of 5, to reduce rounding errors in the G-code. With relative E distances, the rounding error of each move is also carried over to the next one. Supports are removed after printing, so they keep the standard precision. This may help stabilize extrusion with small nozzles (e.g. 0.2 mm) and thin layers (e.g. 0.08 mm or less), where each move extrudes so little material that rounding errors matter most. The effect depends strongly on how well the rest of the settings are tuned and may be hard to notice unless the print profile is well calibrated. The G-code file becomes about 10 percent larger, which may slow down printers that parse G-code slowly."
msgstr ""

msgid "Infill combination"
msgstr "合併填充"

# AI Translated
msgid "Automatically combine sparse infill of several layers to print together in order to reduce time. Walls are still printed with original layer height."
msgstr "自動將多層稀疏填充合併列印，以縮短列印時間。牆仍以原始層高列印。"

msgid "Infill shift step"
msgstr "填充偏移步長"

msgid "This parameter adds a slight displacement to each layer of infill to create a cross texture."
msgstr "此參數為每層填充新增輕微的位移以建立十字紋理。"

msgid "Sparse infill rotation template"
msgstr "稀疏填充旋轉範本"

# AI Translated
msgid "Rotate the sparse infill direction per layer using a template of angles. Enter comma-separated degrees (e.g., '0,30,60,90'). Angles are applied in order by layer and repeat when the list ends. Advanced syntax is supported: '+5' rotates +5° every layer; '+5#5' rotates +5° every 5 layers. See the Wiki for details. When a template is set, the standard infill direction setting is ignored. Note: some infill patterns (e.g., Gyroid) control rotation themselves; use with care."
msgstr "依角度範本逐層旋轉稀疏填充方向。請輸入以逗號分隔的角度（例如 '0,30,60,90'）。角度依層序套用，清單用完後重複。支援進階語法：'+5' 表示每層旋轉 +5°；'+5#5' 表示每 5 層旋轉 +5°。詳情請參閱 Wiki。設定範本後，標準的填充方向設定將被忽略。注意：部分填充圖案（例如螺旋體）會自行控制旋轉，請謹慎使用。"

msgid "Solid infill rotation template"
msgstr "實心填充旋轉範本"

# AI Translated
msgid "This parameter adds a rotation of solid infill direction to each layer according to the specified template. The template is a comma-separated list of angles in degrees, e.g. '0,90'. The first angle is applied to the first layer, the second angle to the second layer, and so on. If there are more layers than angles, the angles will be repeated. Note that not all solid infill patterns support rotation."
msgstr "此參數依指定的範本，為每一層加上實心填充方向的旋轉。範本是以逗號分隔的角度清單（單位為度），例如 '0,90'。第一個角度套用於第一層，第二個角度套用於第二層，依此類推。如果層數多於角度數，角度會重複使用。請注意，並非所有實心填充圖案都支援旋轉。"

msgid "Skeleton infill density"
msgstr "骨架填充密度"

msgid "The remaining part of the model contour after removing a certain depth from the surface is called the skeleton. This parameter is used to adjust the density of this section. When two regions have the same sparse infill settings but different skeleton densities, their skeleton areas will develop overlapping sections. Default is as same as infill density."
msgstr "模型輪廓從表面去除一定深度後剩餘的部分稱為骨架。該參數用於調整該部分的密度。當兩個區域具有相同的稀疏填充設定但不同的骨架密度時，它們的骨架區域將產生重疊部分。預設值與填充密度相同。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Skin infill density"
msgstr "表皮填充密度"

# AI Translated
msgid "The portion of the model's outer surface within a certain depth range is called the skin. This parameter is used to adjust the density of this section. When two regions have the same sparse infill settings but different skin densities, this area will not be split into two separate regions. Default is as same as infill density."
msgstr "模型外表面在一定深度範圍內的部分稱為表皮。此參數用於調整該部分的密度。當兩個區域的稀疏填充設定相同但表皮密度不同時，該區域不會被分割為兩個獨立的區域。預設值與填充密度相同。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Skin infill depth"
msgstr "表皮填充深度"

# AI Translated
msgid "The parameter sets the depth of skin."
msgstr "此參數設定表皮的深度。"

msgid "Infill lock depth"
msgstr "填充鎖定深度"

# AI Translated
msgid "The parameter sets the overlapping depth between the interior and skin."
msgstr "此參數設定內部與表皮之間的重疊深度。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Skin line width"
msgstr "表皮線寬"

# AI Translated
msgid "Adjust the line width of the selected skin paths."
msgstr "調整所選表皮路徑的線寬。"

msgid "Skeleton line width"
msgstr "骨架線寬"

# AI Translated
msgid "Adjust the line width of the selected skeleton paths."
msgstr "調整所選骨架路徑的線寬。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Symmetric infill Y axis"
msgstr "對稱填充 Y 軸"

# AI Translated
msgid "If the model has two parts that are symmetric about the Y axis, and you want these parts to have symmetric textures, please click this option on one of the parts."
msgstr "若模型有兩個相對於 Y 軸對稱的零件，且您希望它們的紋理也對稱，請在其中一個零件上勾選此選項。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Fill pattern tops"
msgstr "填滿圖案頂部"

# AI Translated
msgid "Choose this option if you want to completely fill in the tops of the infill pattern"
msgstr "若要將填充圖案的頂部完全填滿，請選擇此選項"

# AI Translated
msgid "Infill combination - Max layer height"
msgstr "合併填充最大層高"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Maximum layer height for the combined sparse infill.\n"
"\n"
"Set it to 0 or 100% to use the nozzle diameter (for maximum reduction in print time) or a value of ~80% to maximize sparse infill strength.\n"
"\n"
"The number of layers over which infill is combined is derived by dividing this value with the layer height and rounded down to the nearest decimal.\n"
"\n"
"Use either absolute mm values (eg. 0.32mm for a 0.4mm nozzle) or % values (eg 80%). This value must not be larger than the nozzle diameter."
msgstr ""
"合併稀疏填充的最大層高。\n"
"\n"
"設為 0 或 100% 會使用噴嘴直徑（最大程度縮短列印時間），設為約 80% 則可使稀疏填充強度最大化。\n"
"\n"
"合併填充的層數由此值除以層高後向下取整得出。\n"
"\n"
"可使用絕對值 mm（例如 0.4 mm 噴嘴使用 0.32 mm）或 % 值（例如 80%）。此值不得大於噴嘴直徑。"

msgid "Enable clumping detection"
msgstr "啟用結塊偵測"

# AI Translated
msgid "Clumping detection layers"
msgstr "結塊偵測層數"

# AI Translated
msgid "Clumping detection layers."
msgstr "結塊偵測層數。"

msgid "Probing exclude area of clumping"
msgstr "結塊偵測排除區域"

# AI Translated
msgid "Probing exclude area of clumping."
msgstr "結塊偵測排除區域。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Lateral lattice angle 1"
msgstr "側向晶格角度 1"

# AI Translated
msgid "The angle of the first set of Lateral lattice elements in the Z direction. Zero is vertical."
msgstr "Z 軸方向第一組側向晶格的角度，0° 表示垂直方向。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Lateral lattice angle 2"
msgstr "側向晶格角度 2"

# AI Translated
msgid "The angle of the second set of Lateral lattice elements in the Z direction. Zero is vertical."
msgstr "Z 軸方向第二組側向晶格的角度，0° 表示垂直方向。"

msgid "Infill overhang angle"
msgstr "填充懸空角度"

msgid "The angle of the infill angled lines. 60° will result in a pure honeycomb."
msgstr "填充傾斜線的角度。60° 將產生純蜂窩結構。"

msgid "Lightning overhang angle"
msgstr "閃電懸空角度"

msgid "Maximum overhang angle for Lightning infill support propagation."
msgstr "閃電填充支撐傳播的最大懸空角度。"

msgid "Prune angle"
msgstr "修剪角度"

msgid ""
"Controls how aggressively short or unsupported Lightning branches are pruned.\n"
"This angle is converted internally to a per-layer distance."
msgstr ""
"控制短的或無支撐的閃電分支被修剪的積極程度。\n"
"此角度會在內部轉換為每層的距離。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Straightening angle"
msgstr "拉直角度"

msgid "Maximum straightening angle used to simplify Lightning branches."
msgstr "用於簡化閃電分支的最大拉直角度。"

msgid "Sparse infill anchor length"
msgstr "稀疏填充錨線長度"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Connect an infill line to an internal perimeter with a short segment of an additional perimeter. If expressed as percentage (example: 15%) it is calculated over infill extrusion width. Orca Slicer tries to connect two close infill lines to a short perimeter segment. If no such perimeter segment shorter than infill_anchor_max is found, the infill line is connected to a perimeter segment at just one side and the length of the perimeter segment taken is limited to this parameter, but no longer than anchor_length_max.\n"
"Set this parameter to zero to disable anchoring perimeters connected to a single infill line."
msgstr ""
"用一小段額外的牆將填充線連接到內牆。如果以百分比表示（例如 15%），將以填充線寬為基準計算。Orca Slicer 會嘗試用一小段牆連接兩條相鄰的填充線。如果找不到短於 infill_anchor_max 的牆段，填充線只會在一側連接到牆段，所取牆段的長度以此參數為上限，但不超過 anchor_length_max。\n"
"將此參數設為 0，可停用連接單條填充線的錨定牆。"

msgid "0 (no open anchors)"
msgstr "0（無錨線）"

msgid "1000 (unlimited)"
msgstr "1000（無限制）"

msgid "Maximum length of the infill anchor"
msgstr "填充錨線的最大長度"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Connect an infill line to an internal perimeter with a short segment of an additional perimeter. If expressed as percentage (example: 15%) it is calculated over infill extrusion width. Orca Slicer tries to connect two close infill lines to a short perimeter segment. If no such perimeter segment shorter than this parameter is found, the infill line is connected to a perimeter segment at just one side and the length of the perimeter segment taken is limited to infill_anchor, but no longer than this parameter.\n"
"If set to 0, the old algorithm for infill connection will be used, it should create the same result as with 1000 & 0."
msgstr ""
"用一小段額外的牆將填充線連接到內牆。如果以百分比表示（例如 15%），將以填充線寬為基準計算。Orca Slicer 會嘗試用一小段牆連接兩條相鄰的填充線。如果找不到短於此參數的牆段，填充線只會在一側連接到牆段，所取牆段的長度以 infill_anchor 為上限，但不超過此參數。\n"
"若設為 0，將使用舊版填充連接演算法，結果應與設為 1000 和 0 時相同。"

msgid "0 (Simple connect)"
msgstr "0（簡單連接）"

msgid ""
"Filament to print internal sparse infill.\n"
"\"Default\" uses the active object/part filament."
msgstr ""
"用於列印內部稀疏填充的線材。\n"
"「預設」會使用目前作用中的物件/零件線材。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Line width of internal sparse infill. If expressed as a %, it will be computed over the nozzle diameter."
msgstr "內部稀疏填充的線寬。如果以 % 表示，將以噴嘴直徑為基準計算。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Infill/wall overlap"
msgstr "填充/牆重疊"

# AI Translated
#, no-c-format, no-boost-format
msgid "This allows the infill area to be enlarged slightly to overlap with walls for better bonding. The percentage value is relative to the inner wall line width. Set this value to ~10-15% to minimize potential over extrusion and accumulation of material resulting in rough top surfaces."
msgstr "此設定讓填充區域略微擴大，與牆重疊以增強結合。百分比值相對於內牆線寬。建議設為約 10-15%，以盡量減少可能的過度擠出與材料堆積，避免頂面粗糙。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Top/Bottom solid infill/wall overlap"
msgstr "頂部/底部實心填充/牆重疊"

# AI Translated
#, no-c-format, no-boost-format
msgid "Top solid infill area is enlarged slightly to overlap with wall for better bonding and to minimize the appearance of pinholes where the top infill meets the walls. A value of 25-30% is a good starting point, minimizing the appearance of pinholes. The percentage value is relative to the inner wall line width."
msgstr "頂部實心填充區域會略微擴大並與牆重疊，以增強結合，並減少頂部填充與牆交接處出現的針孔。建議從 25-30% 開始，可減少針孔的出現。百分比值相對於內牆線寬。"

# AI Translated
msgid "This is the speed for internal sparse infill."
msgstr "內部稀疏填充的速度。"

msgid "Inherits profile"
msgstr "繼承設定檔"

# AI Translated
msgid "Name of parent profile."
msgstr "上層設定檔名稱。"

msgid "Interface shells"
msgstr "接觸面外殼"

# AI Translated
msgid "Force the generation of solid shells between adjacent materials/volumes. Useful for multi-extruder prints with translucent materials or manual soluble support material."
msgstr "強制在相鄰的材料/體積之間產生實心外殼。適用於使用半透明材料或手動可溶支撐材料的多擠出機列印。"

msgid "Maximum width of a segmented region"
msgstr "分隔區域的最大寬度"

msgid "Maximum width of a segmented region. A value of 0 disables this feature."
msgstr "分隔區域的最大寬度。零表示停用此功能。"

msgid "Interlocking depth of a segmented region"
msgstr "分隔區域的互鎖深度"

# AI Translated
msgid "Interlocking depth of a segmented region. On every other layer, the segmented region is limited to this depth. It will be ignored if \"interlocking_beam\" is enabled. Zero disables this feature."
msgstr "分隔區域的互鎖深度。每隔一層，分隔區域會被限制在此深度內。若啟用 \"interlocking_beam\"，此設定將被忽略。設為 0 可停用此功能。"

msgid "Use beam interlocking"
msgstr "使用梁式互鎖"

# AI Translated
msgid "Generate interlocking beam structure at the locations where different filaments touch. This improves the adhesion between filaments, especially models printed in different materials."
msgstr "在不同線材接觸的位置產生梁式互鎖結構，可增強線材之間的附著力，特別是以不同材料列印的模型。"

msgid "Interlocking beam width"
msgstr "梁式互鎖寬度"

msgid "The width of the interlocking structure beams."
msgstr "梁式互鎖結構寬度。"

msgid "Interlocking direction"
msgstr "梁式互鎖方向"

msgid "Orientation of interlock beams."
msgstr "梁式互鎖結構的排列方向。"

msgid "Interlocking beam layers"
msgstr "梁式互鎖層數"

msgid "The height of the beams of the interlocking structure, measured in number of layers. Less layers is stronger, but more prone to defects."
msgstr "梁式互鎖的交錯高度，以層數計算。層數越少，結構越強，但更容易出現缺陷。"

msgid "Interlocking depth"
msgstr "梁式互鎖深度"

# AI Translated
msgid "The distance from the boundary between filaments to generate interlocking structure, measured in cells. Too few cells will result in poor adhesion."
msgstr "從線材交界處起算、產生互鎖結構的距離，以單元數計算。單元數過少會導致附著力不佳。"

msgid "Interlocking boundary avoidance"
msgstr "梁式互鎖的邊界避讓"

# AI Translated
msgid "The distance from the outside of a model where interlocking structures will not be generated, measured in cells."
msgstr "模型外側不產生互鎖結構的距離，以單元數計算。"

msgid "Ironing type"
msgstr "熨燙類型"

# AI Translated
msgid "Ironing uses a small flow to print at the same height of a surface to make flat surfaces smoother. This setting controls which layers are being ironed."
msgstr "熨燙是以小流量在表面相同的高度再列印一次，使平面更加光滑。此設定控制要熨燙哪些層。"

msgid "No ironing"
msgstr "不熨燙"

# AI Translated
msgid "All top surfaces"
msgstr "所有頂面"

# AI Translated
msgid "Topmost surface only"
msgstr "僅最頂面"

msgid "All solid layers"
msgstr "所有實心層"

# AI Translated
msgid "Ironing Pattern"
msgstr "熨燙圖案"

# AI Translated
msgid "The pattern that will be used when ironing."
msgstr "熨燙時將使用的圖案。"

# AI Translated
msgid "This is the amount of material to be extruded during ironing. It is relative to the flow of normal layer height. Too high a value will result in overextrusion on the surface."
msgstr "熨燙時擠出的材料量，相對於正常層高的流量。數值過高會導致表面過度擠出。"

# AI Translated
msgid "This is the distance between the lines used for ironing."
msgstr "熨燙走線的間距。"

# AI Translated
msgid "The distance to keep from the edges. A value of 0 sets this to half of the nozzle diameter."
msgstr "與邊緣保持的距離。設為 0 時為噴嘴直徑的一半。"

# AI Translated
msgid "This is the print speed for ironing lines."
msgstr "熨燙線的列印速度。"

msgid "Ironing angle offset"
msgstr "熨燙角度偏移"

msgid "The angle of ironing lines offset from the top surface."
msgstr "頂面熨燙紋路的偏移角度。"

msgid "Fixed ironing angle"
msgstr "固定角度熨燙"

# AI Translated
msgid "Use a fixed absolute angle for ironing."
msgstr "以固定的絕對角度熨燙。"

msgid "Ironing expansion"
msgstr "熨燙擴展"

msgid "Expand or contract the ironing area."
msgstr "擴展或收縮熨燙區域。"

msgid "Z contouring enabled"
msgstr "啟用 Z 輪廓處理"

msgid "Enable Z-layer contouring (aka Z-layer anti-aliasing)."
msgstr "啟用 Z 層輪廓處理（又稱 Z 層抗鋸齒）。"

msgid "Minimize wall height angle"
msgstr "最小化牆高角度"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Reduce the height of top-surface perimeters to match the model edge height.\n"
"Affects perimeters with a slope greater than this angle (degrees).\n"
"A reasonable value is 35. Set to 0 to disable."
msgstr ""
"降低頂面牆的高度，使其與模型邊緣高度相符。\n"
"影響坡度大於此角度（度）的牆。\n"
"合理值為 35。設為 0 可停用。"

msgid "Don't alternate fill direction"
msgstr "不交替填充方向"

msgid "Disable alternating fill direction when using Z contouring."
msgstr "使用 Z 輪廓處理時停用交替填充方向。"

msgid "Minimum Z height"
msgstr "最小 Z 高度"

msgid ""
"Minimum Z-layer height.\n"
"Also controls the slicing plane."
msgstr ""
"最小 Z 層高。\n"
"同時控制切片平面。"

# AI Translated
msgid "This G-code is inserted at every layer change after the Z lift."
msgstr "在每次換層、Z 軸抬升之後插入這段 G-code。"

msgid "Clumping detection G-code"
msgstr "結塊偵測 G-code"

msgid "Emit limits to G-code"
msgstr "將限制參數輸出至 G-code"

msgid "Machine limits"
msgstr "裝置限制"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"If enabled, the machine limits will be emitted to G-code file.\n"
"This option will be ignored if the G-code flavor is set to Klipper."
msgstr ""
"啟用後，列印裝置的限制參數會寫入 G-code 檔案。\n"
"若 G-code 風格設為 Klipper，將忽略此選項。"

# AI Translated
msgid "This G-code will be used as a code for the pause print. Users can insert pause G-code in the G-code viewer."
msgstr "這段 G-code 用於暫停列印。使用者可以在 G-code 檢視器中插入暫停 G-code。"

# AI Translated
msgid "This G-code will be used as a custom code."
msgstr "這段 G-code 將作為自訂指令使用。"

msgid "Small area flow compensation (beta)"
msgstr "小面積流量補償（Beta）"

# AI Translated
msgid "Enable flow compensation for small infill areas."
msgstr "啟用小面積填充區域的流量補償。"

msgid "Flow Compensation Model"
msgstr "流量補償模型"

# AI Translated
msgid "Flow Compensation Model, used to adjust the flow for small infill areas. The model is expressed as a comma separated pair of values for extrusion length and flow correction factor. Each pair is on a separate line, followed by a semicolon, in the following format: \"1.234, 5.678;\""
msgstr "流量補償模型，用於調整小填充區域的流量。模型由多組以逗號分隔的數值組成，每組包含擠出長度與流量校正係數。每組各佔一行並以分號結尾，格式如下：\"1.234, 5.678;\""

msgid "Maximum speed X"
msgstr "X 最大速度"

msgid "Maximum speed Y"
msgstr "Y 最大速度"

msgid "Maximum speed Z"
msgstr "Z 最大速度"

msgid "Maximum speed E"
msgstr "E 最大速度"

