msgstr "線框：疊加顯示網格邊；與上方的檢視模式無關"

# AI Translated
msgid "Rebuilds the preview as soon as anything changes. Turn it off on a heavy model if painting or dragging a slider starts to stutter - the preview then waits until you let go."
msgstr "任何變更發生時立即重建預覽。若在大型模型上繪製或拖曳滑桿時開始卡頓，請關閉此選項，預覽會等到您放開後才更新。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Texture layers"
msgstr "紋理圖層"

# AI Translated
msgid "Add layer"
msgstr "新增圖層"

# AI Translated
msgid "Drag onto another layer to reorder. The first layer sits on the bare surface; each one after it adds its relief on top of the ones before."
msgstr "拖曳到另一個圖層上即可重新排序。第一個圖層位於原始表面上；之後的每個圖層都會將其浮雕疊加在前面的圖層之上。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Pick a different image for this layer. The paint, depth and tiling stay as they are."
msgstr "為此圖層選擇其他影像。繪製、深度與平鋪設定都會保持不變。"

# AI Translated
msgid "not painted"
msgstr "未繪製"

# AI Translated
msgid "Brightness, contrast, sharpness, blur and hue, shown on the image and on the model as you set them. Save as copy writes the result to your texture library and points this layer at it."
msgstr "亮度、對比度、銳利度、模糊與色相，設定時會同步顯示在影像與模型上。「另存為副本」會將結果寫入您的紋理庫，並讓此圖層改用該結果。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Move up - applied earlier"
msgstr "上移：較早套用"

# AI Translated
msgid "Move down - applied later"
msgstr "下移：較晚套用"

# AI Translated
msgid "Remove this layer"
msgstr "移除此圖層"

# AI Translated
msgid "Height of the relief: how far white in the texture lifts the surface, in millimetres. Black does not move it at all, unless Midlevel says otherwise."
msgstr "浮雕的高度：紋理中的白色會將表面抬高多少，單位為毫米。黑色完全不會移動表面，除非「中間值」另有設定。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Tile size"
msgstr "平鋪尺寸"

# AI Translated
msgid "Mapped by the model's own UV layout, which is already the placement - one copy of the texture covers it exactly, so there is no tile size to set."
msgstr "依模型自身的 UV 配置映射，該配置本身就是放置方式；紋理的一個副本即可精確覆蓋，因此無需設定平鋪尺寸。"

# AI Translated
msgid "How wide one copy of the texture is on the model. Smaller repeats the pattern more often and makes its detail finer; with Tile off, this is the size of the single copy."
msgstr "紋理的一個副本在模型上的寬度。數值越小，圖案重複越頻繁、細節越精細；關閉「平鋪」時，這就是單一副本的尺寸。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Larger"
msgstr "較大"

# AI Translated
msgid "Smaller"
msgstr "較小"

# AI Translated
msgid "Turns the texture on the surface, in degrees - for lining a pattern up with an edge of the model."
msgstr "在表面上旋轉紋理，單位為度，用於將圖案與模型的邊對齊。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Midlevel"
msgstr "中間值"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Which gray stays where the surface already is. At 0 the texture only pushes outwards; at 0.5 mid-gray stays put, so darker grays cut in and lighter ones still push out - one image both embosses and engraves.\n"
"\n"
"What cuts in has to fit: inside a sharp corner or through a thin wall, a deep cut can pass through the other side."
msgstr ""
"哪一種灰階保持在表面原本的位置。設為 0 時，紋理只會向外推；設為 0.5 時，中灰色保持不動，較暗的灰色向內切入，較亮的灰色仍向外推，因此同一張影像既能凸起也能凹刻。\n"
"\n"
"向內切入的部分必須容納得下：在銳利的內角或薄牆中，較深的切入可能會穿透到另一側。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Deep inward displacement may self-intersect."
msgstr "較深的向內位移可能會自我相交。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Blurs the image before it is used, which rounds off hard steps and removes speckle from a noisy photo. Raise it if the relief looks harsh or grainy; it costs fine detail."
msgstr "在使用前先模糊影像，可圓滑生硬的階差，並去除雜訊照片中的斑點。若浮雕看起來生硬或粗糙，請調高此值；代價是損失細微細節。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Edge fade"
msgstr "邊緣淡化"

# AI Translated
msgid "Flattens the relief as it approaches the edge of the painted area, so it blends into the bare surface instead of stopping at a step."
msgstr "在接近繪製區域邊緣時逐漸壓平浮雕，使其融入原始表面，而不是以階差突然停止。"

# AI Translated
msgid "How far in the fade reaches, as a share of the painted area. Small values soften a narrow band at the edge; 1 flattens almost all of it."
msgstr "淡化向內延伸的範圍，以佔繪製區域的比例表示。數值小時只柔化邊緣的窄帶；設為 1 則幾乎壓平整個區域。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Invert"
msgstr "反轉"

# AI Translated
msgid "Turns the relief inside out: what stood out is cut in, and the other way round. The same as using a negative of the image."
msgstr "將浮雕內外反轉：原本凸起的部分變為切入，反之亦然。效果等同使用影像的負片。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Colors"
msgstr "顏色"

# AI Translated
msgid "Prints the painted area in the texture's colors as well as its relief. Each color is matched to the nearest of your loaded filaments; anything you did not paint keeps the object's own."
msgstr "除了浮雕之外，也以紋理的顏色列印繪製區域。每種顏色都會匹配至已載入線材中最接近的一種；未繪製的部分則保留物件原本的顏色。"

# AI Translated
msgid "This texture is a grayscale height map, so it has no colors to apply. Import a color image to use this."
msgstr "此紋理是灰階高度圖，沒有可套用的顏色。請匯入彩色影像以使用此功能。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Mix filaments"
msgstr "混合線材"

# AI Translated
msgid "Interleaves two filaments to fake the colors in between, so a handful of filaments can cover a photo or a gradient. An image of flat colors prints the same either way. Off uses one filament per area."
msgstr "交錯使用兩種線材來模擬兩者之間的顏色，讓少數幾種線材也能呈現照片或漸層。純色影像無論開關與否，列印結果都相同。關閉時每個區域只使用一種線材。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Mixed colors"
msgstr "混色數量"

# AI Translated
msgid "The most mixed filaments a bake may add. They are picked from the texture's colors, and only the ones the bake actually uses are created."
msgstr "烘焙時最多可新增的混合線材數量。這些混合線材從紋理的顏色中選取，且只會建立烘焙實際用到的那些。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Few"
msgstr "較少"

# AI Translated
msgid "Many"
msgstr "較多"

# AI Translated
#. TRN The %2% part of "%1% printable colors %2%"; %1% is the number of filaments.
#, boost-format
msgid "from %1% filament"
msgid_plural "from %1% filaments"
msgstr[0] "來自 %1% 種線材"

# AI Translated
#. TRN %1% is the number of printable colors, %2% is "from N filaments".
#, boost-format
msgid "%1% printable color %2%"
msgid_plural "%1% printable colors %2%"
msgstr[0] "%1% 種可列印顏色（%2%）"

# AI Translated
msgid "Denoise"
msgstr "降噪"

# AI Translated
msgid "Cleans up single stray triangles of the wrong color, which detail finer than the mesh leaves behind. Raise it if the result looks speckled, lower it if small features are being swallowed."
msgstr "清除顏色錯誤的零星單一三角形，這些是比網格更精細的細節所留下的。若結果看起來有斑點，請調高此值；若小特徵被吞沒，請調低。"

# AI Translated
msgctxt "Texture Displacement"
msgid "Mapping"
msgstr "映射"

# AI Translated
msgid "Triplanar (blended)"
msgstr "三平面（混合）"

# AI Translated
msgid "Triplanar - projects the texture from all three axes at once and blends between them, so a patch wrapping around a sharp edge has no seam."
msgstr "三平面：同時從三個軸向投影紋理並在其間混合，因此包覆銳利邊緣的區塊不會出現接痕。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Cylindrical - wraps the texture around the painted area's own center, for round shapes."
msgstr "圓柱：繞著繪製區域本身的中心包覆紋理，適用於圓形形狀。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Spherical"
msgstr "球面"

# AI Translated
msgid "Spherical - wraps the texture around the painted area's own center in both directions."
msgstr "球面：在兩個方向上繞著繪製區域本身的中心包覆紋理。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Unwrap (LSCM)"
msgstr "展開（LSCM）"

# AI Translated
msgid "Unwrap - flattens the painted area and maps the texture onto it with as little stretching as possible. The area is cut into pieces at its sharp edges first (see Seam angle), so each piece can lie flat on its own."
msgstr "展開：將繪製區域攤平，並以最小的拉伸將紋理映射到其上。區域會先在銳利的邊處切割成多塊（請參閱「縫合線角度」），讓每一塊都能各自攤平。"

# AI Translated
msgid "From view"
msgstr "從視角"

# AI Translated
msgid "From view - projects straight onto the painted area from where you are looking, like a slide projector."
msgstr "從視角：從您目前觀看的位置直接投影到繪製區域上，就像幻燈片投影機一樣。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Model UV"
msgstr "模型 UV"

# AI Translated
msgid "Model UV - uses the texture coordinates the model itself came with, so a texture made for that model lands exactly where it was painted. Nothing is unwrapped, and Tile size does not apply: the model's own layout is the placement."
msgstr "模型 UV：使用模型自帶的紋理座標，因此為該模型製作的紋理會精確落在其繪製的位置。不會展開，「平鋪尺寸」也不適用，因為模型自身的配置就是放置方式。"

# AI Translated
msgid "This model carries no texture coordinates of its own. Only a model imported with a UV channel - a textured OBJ, say - can be mapped by them."
msgstr "此模型沒有自帶的紋理座標。只有匯入時帶有 UV 通道的模型（例如帶紋理的 OBJ）才能依其進行映射。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Open UV editor"
msgstr "開啟 UV 編輯器"

# AI Translated
msgid "Opens the UV editor, where you can see how the texture is laid out over the painted area, cut seams and move the pieces around."
msgstr "開啟 UV 編輯器，您可以在其中查看紋理在繪製區域上的配置方式、切割縫合線，並移動各個區塊。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Not unwrapped yet"
msgstr "尚未展開"

# AI Translated
#, boost-format
msgid "%1% island"
msgid_plural "%1% islands"
msgstr[0] "%1% 個 UV 島"

# AI Translated
msgid "Capture current view"
msgstr "擷取目前視角"

# AI Translated
msgid "Nothing is visible from this angle - turn the model to face the part you want to project onto."
msgstr "從此角度看不到任何內容，請轉動模型，使要投影的部分朝向您。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Projects the texture onto the painted area from where you are looking now, like a slide projector. Faces turned away from you stretch, so line the view up with the surface you care about first."
msgstr "從您目前觀看的位置將紋理投影到繪製區域上，就像幻燈片投影機一樣。背向您的面會被拉伸，因此請先將視角對準您在意的表面。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Project only on visible"
msgstr "僅投影至可見面"

# AI Translated
msgid "Paints only the faces you can actually see right now - facing you and not hidden behind anything - and projects onto those. Replaces what the layer had painted."
msgstr "僅繪製您目前實際看得到的面（朝向您且未被任何東西遮擋），並投影到這些面上。會取代此圖層原本繪製的內容。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Projection frame"
msgstr "投影框"

# AI Translated
msgid "Opens a window you drag over the model. Whatever you can see through it is what gets the texture, and its border becomes the edge of the projection."
msgstr "開啟一個可拖曳到模型上的視窗。透過它所看到的部分都會套用紋理，其邊框即成為投影的邊緣。"

# AI Translated
msgid "How solid the frame window looks while you place it. Lower to see the model through it; it does not affect the result."
msgstr "放置投影框時視窗的不透明程度。調低可透過它看到模型；不會影響結果。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Apply projection frame"
msgstr "套用投影框"

# AI Translated
msgid "Nothing of the model is inside the frame - move it over the part you want to project onto."
msgstr "投影框內沒有模型的任何部分，請將投影框移到要投影的部分上。"

# AI Translated
msgid "The frame could not be applied. Make sure it overlaps the 3D view."
msgstr "無法套用投影框。請確認它與 3D 視圖重疊。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Projects the texture through the frame from where you are looking now and paints the faces inside it. Replaces what the layer had painted; the result sticks to the model, so you can orbit afterwards."
msgstr "從您目前觀看的位置透過投影框投影紋理，並繪製框內的面。會取代此圖層原本繪製的內容；結果會固定在模型上，因此之後可以自由環繞檢視。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Placed by projection frame."
msgstr "已由投影框放置。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Tile"
msgstr "平鋪"

# AI Translated
msgid "Repeats the texture across the painted area. Off places one copy, like a decal, at the size set by Tile size."
msgstr "在繪製區域上重複紋理。關閉時則以「平鋪尺寸」設定的大小放置單一副本，就像貼花一樣。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Turn Tile on to choose how the texture repeats."
msgstr "開啟「平鋪」以選擇紋理的重複方式。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Mirrored repeat"
msgstr "鏡像重複"

# AI Translated
msgid "Mirrored repeat - every other tile is flipped, so edges meet seamlessly"
msgstr "鏡像重複：每隔一塊翻轉一次，使邊緣無縫銜接"

# AI Translated
msgid "Blend"
msgstr "混合"

# AI Translated
msgctxt "Texture Displacement"
msgid "Add"
msgstr "相加"

# AI Translated
msgctxt "Texture Displacement"
msgid "Override"
msgstr "覆蓋"

# AI Translated
msgctxt "Texture Displacement"
msgid "Subtract"
msgstr "相減"

# AI Translated
msgctxt "Texture Displacement"
msgid "Multiply"
msgstr "相乘"

# AI Translated
msgid "Divide"
msgstr "相除"

# AI Translated
msgid "The base layer has nothing beneath it to combine with, so it always adds."
msgstr "基底圖層下方沒有可結合的內容，因此一律為相加。"

# AI Translated
msgid "What this layer does where it overlaps the ones below. Add and Subtract pile relief on or carve it away. Override replaces them, so only this layer's relief is left where it is painted. Multiply and Divide scale what is underneath, which turns this layer into a mask over it - there, Depth acts as a strength, and 1 mm leaves white areas untouched."
msgstr "此圖層在與下方圖層重疊處的作用方式。「相加」與「相減」會疊加浮雕或將其削去。「覆蓋」會取代下方圖層，因此在繪製處只保留此圖層的浮雕。「相乘」與「相除」會縮放下方的內容，使此圖層成為覆蓋其上的遮罩；此時「深度」代表強度，設為 1 mm 時白色區域保持不變。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Adjust placement"
msgstr "調整位置"

# AI Translated
msgid "Adjust placement - drag the handle on the model to move the texture"
msgstr "調整位置：拖曳模型上的控點以移動紋理"

# AI Translated
msgid "Paint something with this layer first."
msgstr "請先用此圖層繪製一些內容。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Fewer settings"
msgstr "較少設定"

# AI Translated
msgid "More settings"
msgstr "更多設定"

# AI Translated
msgid "Subdivision"
msgstr "細分"

# AI Translated
msgid "Only painted area (adaptive)"
msgstr "僅限繪製區域（適應性）"

# AI Translated
msgid "Adds triangles only where you painted, instead of everywhere. On a large part with a small decal that is the difference between thousands of triangles and millions, and your paint survives the refinement."
msgstr "只在您繪製的地方增加三角形，而非整個模型。對於帶有小型貼花的大型零件，這就是數千個與數百萬個三角形的差別，而且您的繪製在細化後仍會保留。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Follow texture detail"
msgstr "跟隨紋理細節"

# AI Translated
msgid "Spends the triangles where the texture actually bends - packed along ridges and edges, sparse over flat ground - instead of spreading them evenly. The same detail for fewer triangles on most textures."
msgstr "將三角形用在紋理實際彎折之處（沿著脊線與邊緣密集排列，在平坦處則稀疏），而非平均分布。對大多數紋理而言，能以較少的三角形達到相同細節。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Max edge"
msgstr "最大邊長"

# AI Translated
msgid "Target edge"
msgstr "目標邊長"

# AI Translated
msgid "No triangle in the painted area stays larger than this, even where the texture is flat. Keep it near the size of the smallest feature you want to come out."
msgstr "繪製區域中不會有任何三角形大於此值，即使在紋理平坦之處也是如此。請將其保持在接近您想呈現的最小特徵尺寸。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Triangles in the painted area are split until none is larger than this. Smaller means finer detail and, fast, a lot more triangles."
msgstr "繪製區域中的三角形會持續分割，直到沒有任何三角形大於此值。數值越小細節越精細，但三角形數量也會迅速大幅增加。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Detail"
msgstr "細節"

# AI Translated
msgid "How far the mesh may sit from the shape the texture describes, in millimetres. Smaller follows fine detail and costs triangles; larger only chases the big features."
msgstr "網格與紋理所描述的形狀之間允許的偏差，單位為毫米。數值越小越能貼合細微細節，但會耗費三角形；數值越大則只追隨較大的特徵。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Min edge"
msgstr "最小邊長"

# AI Translated
msgid "A floor on triangle size, so a sharp step in the texture cannot be chased forever. Lower it for finer relief, raise it if the count runs away at hard edges."
msgstr "三角形尺寸的下限，避免無止境地追隨紋理中的銳利階差。調低可得到更精細的浮雕；若三角形數量在硬邊處失控，請調高。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Edge detail"
msgstr "邊緣細節"

# AI Translated
msgid "Triangle size along the outline of the painted area, where the relief drops back to the bare surface. Lower it if that rim looks jagged; it only costs triangles along the outline. 0 turns it off."
msgstr "沿著繪製區域輪廓的三角形尺寸，也就是浮雕回落至原始表面之處。若邊緣看起來呈鋸齒狀，請調低此值；只會在輪廓上耗費三角形。設為 0 可關閉。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Color detail"
msgstr "顏色細節"

# AI Translated
msgid "Triangle size where two colors meet. Each triangle prints in one filament, so a color edge can only be as sharp as the triangles along it - and nothing else refines there, since the surface is flat across a change of color. 0 turns it off."
msgstr "兩種顏色交界處的三角形尺寸。每個三角形只以一種線材列印，因此顏色邊界的銳利程度取決於沿線的三角形；而且由於顏色變化處的表面是平的，那裡不會有其他細化。設為 0 可關閉。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Triangle budget: set with Triangles, below."
msgstr "三角形預算：由下方的「三角形」設定。"

# AI Translated
#, boost-format
msgid "Preview: %1% triangle"
msgid_plural "Preview: %1% triangles"
msgstr[0] "預覽：%1% 個三角形"

# AI Translated
msgid "Steps"
msgstr "細分次數"

# AI Translated
msgid "Splits every triangle of the model into four, this many times over. Each step quadruples the count - 3 turns 100 k triangles into 6.4 M - so prefer refining only the painted area unless you need the whole model finer."
msgstr "將模型的每個三角形分割為四個，並重複此次數。每一次都會使數量變為四倍（3 次會將 100 k 個三角形變成 6.4 M 個），因此除非需要整個模型都更精細，否則建議只細化繪製區域。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Hide preview"
msgstr "隱藏預覽"

# AI Translated
msgid "Preview subdivision"
msgstr "預覽細分"

# AI Translated
msgid "Shows what the refinement would produce as a wireframe, without touching the model."
msgstr "以線框顯示細化後的結果，不會變更模型。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Subdivide"
msgstr "細分"

# AI Translated
msgid "Refines the painted area to the target edge length and carries your paint onto the finer mesh. The rest of the model is left as it is."
msgstr "將繪製區域細化至目標邊長，並將您的繪製轉移到更細的網格上。模型的其餘部分保持不變。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Replaces the model's geometry with the subdivided mesh and clears any not-yet-baked paint on it (already-baked relief is unaffected)."
msgstr "以細分後的網格取代模型幾何，並清除其上尚未烘焙的繪製（已烘焙的浮雕不受影響）。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Remeshing"
msgstr "重新網格化"

# AI Translated
msgid "Triangle size the whole model is rebuilt with, in millimetres. Displacement works best on an even mesh; this is what makes one out of an uneven import."
msgstr "重建整個模型時使用的三角形尺寸，單位為毫米。位移在均勻的網格上效果最佳；這能將不均勻的匯入模型轉為均勻網格。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Before"
msgstr "處理前"

# AI Translated
msgid "After"
msgstr "處理後"

# AI Translated
msgid "Keep sharp edges"
msgstr "保留銳利邊"

# AI Translated
msgid "Holds hard edges and open borders in place while the rest is remeshed. Without it the remesher slides vertices along the surface and rounds every crisp edge off - a cube comes back with wobbly edges."
msgstr "在重新網格化其餘部分時，固定硬邊與開放邊界。若未啟用，重新網格化會讓頂點沿表面滑動，使每條銳利的邊都變圓，立方體的邊會變得歪扭不平。"

# AI Translated
msgid "How sharp a fold has to be, in degrees, before the remesher treats it as an edge worth keeping. Lower protects more of the model's shape; higher rebuilds more of it evenly."
msgstr "摺角需要多銳利（單位為度），重新網格化時才會將其視為值得保留的邊。數值越低越能保護模型的形狀；數值越高則會更均勻地重建更多部分。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Remesh"
msgstr "重新網格化"

# AI Translated
msgid "Rebuilds the whole model with triangles close to this edge length - splitting the big ones and merging the small ones - so displacement has an even density to work with. Replaces the geometry; your paint is carried onto the new triangles spatially, so it survives (already-baked relief is kept too)."
msgstr "以接近此邊長的三角形重建整個模型（分割大的三角形並合併小的三角形），讓位移有均勻的密度可用。會取代幾何；您的繪製會依空間位置轉移到新的三角形上，因此會保留下來（已烘焙的浮雕也會保留）。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Displace up to the border"
msgstr "位移延伸至邊界"

# AI Translated
msgid "Lets the relief run right to the edge of the painted area. Turn it off to hold that outer ring flat, which keeps the displacement strictly inside your paint but flattens the pattern at the border."
msgstr "讓浮雕一直延伸到繪製區域的邊緣。關閉後會讓最外圈保持平坦，使位移嚴格限制在繪製範圍內，但邊界處的圖案會被壓平。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Smooth result"
msgstr "平滑結果"

# AI Translated
msgid "Smooths the geometry after the texture has been applied, to take the hard steps out of a low-resolution image. Only what the displacement moved is touched. The Smoothing slider on a layer is a different thing: it blurs the image before it is used."
msgstr "在套用紋理後平滑幾何，以消除低解析度影像造成的生硬階差。只會影響位移移動過的部分。圖層上的「平滑」滑桿則是另一回事：它會在使用影像前先將其模糊。"

# AI Translated
msgctxt "Texture Displacement"
msgid "Strength"
msgstr "強度"

# AI Translated
msgid "How far each pass pulls a vertex towards its neighbours. High values round the relief off quickly; low values need more passes but keep more of the detail."
msgstr "每次平滑將頂點拉向相鄰頂點的程度。數值高會快速圓化浮雕；數值低則需要更多次數，但能保留更多細節。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Passes"
msgstr "次數"

# AI Translated
msgid "How many smoothing passes to run. More passes spread the smoothing further across the surface; Strength decides how much each one moves."
msgstr "要執行的平滑次數。次數越多，平滑效果會在表面上擴散得越遠；「強度」決定每次移動的幅度。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Ignore outer ring"
msgstr "忽略外圈"

# AI Translated
msgid "Keeps the outer ring of the painted area out of the smoothing. Its neighbours outside the paint never move, so smoothing it drags the relief down and leaves the pattern half-melted at the border."
msgstr "將繪製區域的最外圈排除在平滑之外。最外圈在繪製範圍外的相鄰頂點永遠不會移動，因此平滑它會把浮雕往下拉，使邊界處的圖案看起來像半融化。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Smooth baked mesh now"
msgstr "立即平滑已烘焙的網格"

# AI Translated
msgid "Applies the smoothing above to the model itself, right now, within the painted area. For relief that is already baked in - anything not yet baked is smoothed by Bake."
msgstr "立即在繪製區域內將上述平滑套用至模型本身。適用於已烘焙的浮雕；尚未烘焙的部分會由「烘焙」平滑。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Experimental: classic bake pipeline"
msgstr "實驗性：經典烘焙流程"

# AI Translated
msgid "Bake by moving the vertices the mesh already has, after preparing it (remesh, adaptive subdivision, and a cut along sharp steps in the texture). Keeps the topology, which is what colors need. The default pipeline instead refines, cleans up sliver triangles, displaces and simplifies in one run; nothing needs preparing first, but it does not produce colors yet."
msgstr "在準備好網格（重新網格化、適應性細分，以及沿紋理中的銳利階差切割）後，藉由移動網格現有的頂點進行烘焙。會保留拓撲，這是顏色所需要的。預設流程則會一次完成細化、清理狹長三角形、位移與簡化；不需要事先準備，但目前還無法產生顏色。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Align mesh to texture edges"
msgstr "將網格對齊紋理邊緣"

# AI Translated
msgid "Slide vertices sideways onto the edges in the texture before displacing them. Displacement can only move vertices up and down, so without this a sharp step in the image lands wherever the triangles happen to be and comes out as a staircase. Moving the vertices onto the step first gives a straight wall at the same triangle count."
msgstr "在位移之前，先將頂點橫向滑動到紋理中的邊緣上。位移只能上下移動頂點，若未啟用，影像中的銳利階差會落在三角形剛好所在的位置，結果呈現階梯狀。先將頂點移到階差上，就能以相同的三角形數量得到筆直的牆面。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Clean up slivers"
msgstr "清理狹長三角形"

# AI Translated
msgid "Collapse the thin triangles refinement inherits from the model's own tessellation, before displacement samples them. A sliver's three corners land on three unrelated parts of the texture, which is what makes the relief look jagged."
msgstr "在位移取樣之前，先收合細化從模型原有鑲嵌繼承而來的狹長三角形。狹長三角形的三個角會落在紋理中三個不相關的位置，這正是浮雕看起來呈鋸齒狀的原因。"

# AI Translated
#. TRN Slider value: %d is the triangle budget in thousands
msgid "Budget"
msgstr "預算"

# AI Translated
#, c-format, boost-format
msgid "%d k (auto)"
msgstr "%d k（自動）"

# AI Translated
msgid "How many thousand triangles this bake may spend on the area you painted. Relief already baked into the rest of the model is kept on top of it, so a second bake somewhere else gets the same budget as the first. Raise it if the warning below Resolution says the detail will not fit; 0 keeps every triangle the refinement produced, however many that is."
msgstr "此次烘焙在您繪製的區域上可使用多少千個三角形。模型其餘部分已烘焙的浮雕會額外保留，因此在其他地方進行第二次烘焙時，可獲得與第一次相同的預算。若「解析度」下方的警告指出細節無法容納，請調高此值；設為 0 會保留細化產生的所有三角形，無論數量多少。"

# AI Translated
msgid "On: the resolution follows the size of the model and the budget is left at its default. Untick to set both yourself - worth doing for a texture much finer or much coarser than the part it sits on."
msgstr "開啟：解析度依模型尺寸決定，預算維持預設值。取消勾選即可自行設定兩者；當紋理比其所在的零件精細或粗糙許多時，值得這麼做。"

# AI Translated
#, c-format, boost-format
msgid "%.2f mm (auto)"
msgstr "%.2f mm（自動）"

# AI Translated
#, boost-format
msgid "Chosen from the size of the model: %1$.2f mm triangles, budget %2% k. Untick Auto to set them yourself."
msgstr "依模型尺寸選定：三角形尺寸 %1$.2f mm，預算 %2% k。取消勾選「自動」即可自行設定。"

# AI Translated
msgid "How fine the mesh is made under the paint, in millimetres. It has to be smaller than the detail you want out of the texture - a 0.5 mm groove needs triangles well under 0.5 mm. Smaller costs triangles fast: halving it needs four times as many, and once they no longer fit the budget the bake simplifies back down and the detail goes with it."
msgstr "繪製區域下方網格的精細程度，單位為毫米。必須小於您想從紋理中呈現的細節（0.5 mm 的溝槽需要遠小於 0.5 mm 的三角形）。數值越小，三角形耗費得越快：減半就需要四倍的數量，一旦超出預算，烘焙會將網格簡化回去，細節也會隨之流失。"

# AI Translated
#, boost-format
msgid "Needs about %1% triangles, budget %2% - the bake will simplify back down and lose detail."
msgstr "需要約 %1% 個三角形，預算為 %2%，烘焙將會簡化網格並損失細節。"

# AI Translated
msgid "How many thousand triangles the refinement may add to the model. The triangle that fits worst is always split first, so even a run that spends the lot has spent it where it shows most. Raise it if the relief still looks coarse."
msgstr "細化可在模型上增加多少千個三角形。最不貼合的三角形一律優先分割，因此即使用完全部預算，也是用在最明顯的地方。若浮雕看起來仍然粗糙，請調高此值。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Preparing..."
msgstr "準備中..."

# AI Translated
msgid "Baking..."
msgstr "烘焙中..."

# AI Translated
msgid "Nothing is painted yet. The UV editor's seam tool is on, so strokes on the model mark seams instead of painting - turn it off in the pane to paint."
msgstr "尚未繪製任何內容。UV 編輯器的縫合線工具已開啟，因此在模型上的筆劃會標記縫合線而非繪製；請在窗格中關閉此工具後再繪製。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Nothing is painted yet."
msgstr "尚未繪製任何內容。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Turn the painted height maps into real geometry, by moving the vertices that are already there. Use Subdivide first if the mesh is too coarse to show the detail."
msgstr "藉由移動現有的頂點，將繪製的高度圖轉換為真實幾何。若網格太粗糙而無法呈現細節，請先使用「細分」。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Turn the painted height maps into real geometry. The mesh is remeshed to an even density and refined where the texture bends first, so the detail has vertices to land on - all in one step."
msgstr "將繪製的高度圖轉換為真實幾何。網格會先重新網格化為均勻密度，並在紋理彎折處細化，讓細節有頂點可以落腳，全部一步完成。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Stops the bake. Whatever it had already finished stays on the model, and can be undone."
msgstr "停止烘焙。已完成的部分會保留在模型上，且可以復原。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Closes the tool without baking. Your paint, layers and settings stay with the model."
msgstr "關閉工具而不進行烘焙。您的繪製、圖層與設定都會保留在模型上。"

