# AI Translated
msgid "Edges sharper than this are cut, and the pieces either side of them are flattened separately. Lower it to cut more: each piece then lies flat with less stretching, at the cost of the texture not running continuously across the cut. Takes effect at the next Unwrap."
msgstr "比此角度更銳利的邊會被切開，其兩側的區塊會分別攤平。調低可切割更多：每個區塊攤平時的拉伸較少，代價是紋理無法連續跨越切口。於下次「展開」時生效。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Connect islands"
msgstr "連接 UV 島"

# AI Translated
msgid "Lay the unwrap out as a connected net: pieces that share an edge are unfolded next to each other (a cube becomes a joined net rather than six loose squares). They stay separate islands, so you can still move any of them by hand afterwards."
msgstr "將展開結果排列成相連的展開圖：共用邊的區塊會相鄰展開（立方體會變成相連的展開圖，而不是六個分散的正方形）。它們仍是各自獨立的 UV 島，因此之後仍可手動移動任一個。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Island - work on whole islands. Click one to select it, then drag to move it, right-drag to rotate it, or press R to rotate and S to scale with the mouse (click or Enter to confirm, Esc to cancel)."
msgstr "UV 島：以整個 UV 島為單位操作。點選一個 UV 島以選取，然後拖曳可移動、按右鍵拖曳可旋轉，或按 R 旋轉、按 S 以滑鼠縮放（點選或按 Enter 確認，按 Esc 取消）。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Vertex - drag vertices to reshape an island by hand; Shift adds to the selection, Ctrl toggles one in or out of it."
msgstr "頂點：拖曳頂點以手動調整 UV 島的形狀；按住 Shift 可加入選取，按住 Ctrl 可切換單一頂點是否選取。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Edge - drag edges to reshape an island by hand; Shift adds to the selection, Ctrl toggles one in or out of it."
msgstr "邊：拖曳邊以手動調整 UV 島的形狀；按住 Shift 可加入選取，按住 Ctrl 可切換單一邊是否選取。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Mark seams - click edges on the model to cut the unwrap along them. The edge under the cursor is highlighted yellow; click to mark it red, click a red edge again to unmark it. Painting is paused while this is on."
msgstr "標記縫合線：點選模型上的邊，沿著這些邊切開展開結果。游標下方的邊會以黃色醒目提示；點選可將它標記為紅色，再次點選紅色的邊即可取消標記。開啟時會暫停繪製。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Path - instead of clicking every edge, click a start point and then an end point: the whole shortest path between them is seamed at once. Available while marking seams."
msgstr "路徑：不必逐一點選每條邊，只要點選起點再點選終點，兩點之間的整條最短路徑就會一次標記為縫合線。標記縫合線時可用。"

# AI Translated
msgid "Clear seams - remove every seam marked on this layer"
msgstr "清除縫合線：移除此圖層上標記的所有縫合線"

# AI Translated
msgid "Average scale - give every island the same texel density"
msgstr "平均縮放：讓每個 UV 島具有相同的紋素密度"

# AI Translated
msgid "Cut - split the selected island across its long axis"
msgstr "切割：橫向切過長軸，將所選 UV 島一分為二"

# AI Translated
msgid "Join - unfold the selected island onto its nearest neighbour along their shared edge"
msgstr "接合：沿共用邊將所選 UV 島展開接到最近的相鄰 UV 島上"

# AI Translated
msgid "Unjoin - send the selected island back to its own packed position"
msgstr "取消接合：將所選 UV 島送回其原本的排列位置"

# AI Translated
msgid "Clear UV edits - discard all manual vertex/edge moves and return the unwrap to its automatic shape"
msgstr "清除 UV 編輯：捨棄所有手動移動的頂點/邊，並將展開結果恢復為自動產生的形狀"

# AI Translated
